<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- Luyana Bible Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">MALEKA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Eliywi no kuwaba okukumanena ni Maleka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Maleka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mal</para>
  <para style="mt2">ELIYWI OKUKUMANENA KWA</para>
  <para style="mt1">MALEKA</para>
  <para style="io1">Okulimukisa</para>
  <para style="ip">Okwamana ku Liywi lya Maleka.</para>
  <para style="ip">Eliywi okwamana kwa Maleka ni injili notibuka tinee na mu Testamente no ubya eyo italusa oupilo wa Jesu Kilesite. Enjili ni injili kama iisanwa “eliywi” eyi italusa etingambolo no kuwaba. Kama ina ku n̄oliwa munyima no lufu lwa Jesu kwa Mateu, Maleka, Luka ni Jodani. Eliywi okwamana ni Maleka ni lyakwibiba onene ku man̄olo anee. Kama lilumelwa kame nji eli na ku ngoliwa oweli ku man̄olo onje mutinako tinjili mukaci no 65-70 AD munyima noku leiwakwa Jesu. Aanokupula asikukwiyeta kama alumela nji kama ina ku n̄oliwa mu Loma mulibaka no kususuweza oulapeli no maloma muya.</para>
  <para style="ip">Maleka, kame alimukiwa nji yokame Jodani Maleka, kama ana kwendanga ni mutumiwa Paulusi ni Banabasi, kono omukwa waye neli owo no kwiiba abo abaana kwaasiya aba nakutazanga eliywi (Tikezo13.13). Munyima kame Maleka sebeli weenda ni Banabasi (Tikezo 15.37-39). Maleka kama ana kulimukiwa kame nji neli mulikani waye Pitolosi munene (1 Pitolosi 5.13). Simba nji Maleka kakwite oupaki no kumona ni miyo ku upilo wa Jesu, asikukwiyeta kama alumela nji Maleka kama ana kun̄ola onene eyambo ya Pitolosi eyi yamana ni upilo wa Jesu mi eso esitundo no liywi okwamana kwa Maleka. Mu liywi, Maleka kamaama onene eyi no aiyetwa ni tuto ya Jesu munako no mamaneneno.</para>
  <para style="iot">Emitwi no yambo</para>
  <para style="io1">Maleka kame alimukisa ebuka mu kauhanyo 1.1-13.</para>
  <para style="io1">Cwale Maleka kama atoloka esitulo sa Jesu abo yooli mu Galileya mu kauhanyo 1.14, 8.21.</para>
  <para style="io1">Eiitatamako kamaamba eino musipili wa Jesu ku Jelusalema (8.22, 10.52).</para>
  <para style="io1">Maleka kamaamana okun̄ola enako ya Jesu mu Jelusalema, okwekeza olufu ni kwinguka kwaye (11.1-16, 8).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1"/>
  <para style="s">Okukutaza kwa Jodani omukolobezi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mateu3.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka3.1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Jowani1.19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1"/>Aa amaywi no Kuwaba a Jesu Kilesite Omwana Nyambe. <verse eid="MRK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2"/>Kanyi omo ku n̄olelwe mu buka no omunuhi wa Nyambe Isaya nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">“Omone, ‘Kame ni tuma onumwana wange balubala no lubala lowe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:2">woyo so lukisa endila yowe,’<verse eid="MRK 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3"/>Eliywi lya woyo okuweleza mu lihalaupa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">Mu lukise endila no Mbumu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">mutende etindila no kooloka nji yonyene abitemo.”<verse eid="MRK 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4"/>Cwale Jowani omukolobezi sebeli omonahala mu lihalaupa, yo lemine okukutaza ekutazo no kubaka nji, “Mufutuke mi mu kolobeziwe cwale Nyambe mbami lemene ouyi wenu.” <verse eid="MRK 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5"/>Aanu no kupula ali mu tolopo no Judeya onje, naa ayakile mu mulenen̄i no Jelusalema onje, sebeli abanena kwa yonyene mukuteeteta, mi asimana okwamba etifoso too, sebeli akolobeziwa mu musindi wa Jodani kwa Jowani.<verse eid="MRK 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6"/>Jowani kame ano kufuka esikumango no woya no kamele, ni lukanda no situmba mu mbunda, mi kame ana kuyoya etimbimba ni uki mu mushitu. <verse eid="MRK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7"/>Mi kame ana kwiiyeta aanu nji, “Mu nyima yange, kame kwiiya omunjili uyu unibita ku maata, mi kanilukela okwinama ni kunungutula etikwele no tinjatangwa taye. <verse eid="MRK 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8"/>Mene, kame ni mikolobeza ni meyi, kono yonyene kame sami kolobeze ni Mebo No Kukena.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Aba Ana Kukolobeziwa ni Kwetekiwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:3-4">Mateu3.3-4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11">11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21">Luka3.21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22">22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4.1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9"/>Ba nako eyo, Jesu sebeli otunda mu Nazaleta omundi na mu tolopo no Galileya, mi sebeli okolobeziwa kwa Jowani mu musindi no Jodani. <verse eid="MRK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10"/>Ababo Jesu aba ana kukatunda mu meyi, sebeli omona eliwilu liyatuluka, mi Emebo No Kukena ifeka kanyi elikwici sebeli ishulumukela kwa yonyene. <verse eid="MRK 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11"/>Mi sebeli ku yupahala eliywi litundelela ku wilu, elyamba nji, “Wene yo mwana nge osingwa, uyu ni katelelwa onene.”<verse eid="MRK 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12"/>Ababo, Emebo No Kukena sebeli imutwala mu lihalaupa. <verse eid="MRK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13"/>Jesu sebeli okaikala mu lihalaupa amaywaa makumi anee, yo etekiwa kwa Satani. Mi kame ana kwikalanga ni ibatana, mi amangeloi na ku mu babalela.<verse eid="MRK 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Iyeta Eliywi no Kuwaba mu Galileya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mateu4.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14">Luka4.14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 4:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">5.1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14"/>Cwale munyima no kunungiwa kwa Jowani ni kubeekiwa mu tolongo, Jesu sebeli oiya mu Galileya yo kutaza eliywi no kuwaba lya Nyambe. <verse eid="MRK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15"/>Mi sebeli wamba nji, “Enako na ikwana, mi omubuso wa Nyambe kame uli beebi. Mubake, mi mu pumene ku liywi no kuwaba.”<verse eid="MRK 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Yo Isana Ayambi Anee (Mateu 4.18-22, Luka 5.1-11)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16"/>Cwale Jesu aba na endanga ku munanga no lisa no Galileya, sebeli omona Simoni ni minaye Adiliyasi, ayamba otunyandi too mu liwate kakuli neli anduyi.<verse eid="MRK 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17"/>Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Munikon̄e, mi kame sa ni mitende asiku yamba aanu.” <verse eid="MRK 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18"/>Mi ababo sebeli asiya otunyandi too ni kumukon̄a.<verse eid="MRK 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19"/>Aba ana kusheteta kuusombicani, sebeli omona Jakobo mwanaa Zebedeya ni Jowani minaye, nonyene kame ana kwikala mu wato, alemine okoongolola otunyandi too. <verse eid="MRK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20"/>Mi ababo sebeli waaisana mu wangu, mi sebeli asiya sitoo Zebedeya mu wato nawo ana kuteneka okwatusa ni kumukon̄a.<verse eid="MRK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Omulume no Mebo no Kwiiba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luka4.31-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21"/>Mi sebeli ata mu Kapenauma, mi ababo ba liywaa no Pumulo, Jesu sebeli oingena mu Ndoo no milapelo no Majuda ni kwiiyeta. <verse eid="MRK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22"/>Aanu sebeli akomoka onene mulibaka no tuto yaye, kakuli kame ana kwiyeta kanyi omunu oli ni maata, kasa kanyi aiyeti no mulawo.<verse eid="MRK 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23"/>Ababo, aali mu Ndoo no milapelo omulume no mebo no kwakena, sebeli wiiya nikukuwa nji, <verse eid="MRK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24"/>“Iikene usaela kwaaci wene Jesu no Nazaleta? Ninji kame oneeyi mu kutumana? Ni ku limukile nji tiwe anyine, tiwe Woyo no Kukena omutumiwa wa Nyambe.”<verse eid="MRK 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25"/>Kono Jesu sebeli oikalimela nji, “Ondoka! Otunde mwa yonyene.”<verse eid="MRK 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26"/>Cwale emebo no kwakena sebeli imukwiseta banji mu koongola, mi sebeli itunda mwa yonyene yokuwa ni liywi no ku neneba. <verse eid="MRK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27"/>Mi aanu onje sebeli akomoka, sebeli akwambisa mukaci koo nji, “Esi ni siikene? Eyi ni tuto no ubya? Kame akwite amaata no kulaela emebo no kwiiba, mi kame imu kuteka!”<verse eid="MRK 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28"/>Ababo elibubo lyaye sebeli lita kule, mu tolopo yonje no Galileya.<verse eid="MRK 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Balisa Aanu no Kupula</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mateu8.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luka4.38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29"/>Cwale ababo Jesu aba natunda mu Ndoo no milapelo no Majuda, sebeli oingena mu ndoo ya Simoni ni Adiliyasi, yoli ni Jakobo ni Jowani. <verse eid="MRK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30"/>Cwale onjemunwaa Simoni no mukati kame ana langananga, yotomine oweti no fibele eyi ingangamisa, ababo sebeli asimweta Jesu muwangu. <verse eid="MRK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31"/>Cwale sebeli osheteteta kwa yonyene, niku mulema ku lyoko mi sebeli omwingula, sebeli obala kuweeti no fibele, mi sebeli waa sebeleza.<verse eid="MRK 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32"/>Amangolwaa, eliywaa aba lina kwiika, sebeli ku litwa kwa yonyene asi kutoma, naa aingenwe Emebo no kwiiba. <verse eid="MRK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33"/>Aanu mu mulenen̄i wonje sebeli aungana ba mwelo waye. <verse eid="MRK 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34"/>Mi cwale sebeli obalisa aanu no kupula awo ana kutomanga ameeti no mifuta-futa, ni kucita Emebo no kwiiba no kupula, mi kasipumenena Emebo no kwiiba nji yaambe kakuli kame imulimukile.<verse eid="MRK 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Iyeta mu Galileya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Luka4.42-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35"/>Amalungasiku, eliywaa elyakalisipa kale, Jesu sebeli oinguka, ni kuta ku sibaka no mbulwa aanu okuno kuleba yomboci oka lapela. <verse eid="MRK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36"/>Cwale Simoni naa ana kwikala naye mu ndoo sebeli ata mu ku musaela. <verse eid="MRK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37"/>Asimana oku muwana, sebeli amwambela nji, “Aanu onje kame aku saela.”<verse eid="MRK 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38"/>Cwale sebeli waatambula nji, “Twendeni kwibaka indina lili beebi ni mindi, ni ka kutazeko kame, kakuli omusebezi nina iyele.” <verse eid="MRK 1:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39"/>Mi sebeli ota ngeeso ni mu Galileya monje, yo kutaza mu tindoo no milapelo no Majuda, ni kucita Emebo no kwiiba.<verse eid="MRK 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Yobalisa Omulume osi Mbingwa.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mateu8.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luka5.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40"/>Cwale omulume osi mbingwa sebeli wiiya kwa Jesu ni ku mukubamena ni manwi okukumbela ni kumwambela nji, “Nji aba usinga, kame utwesa okunibalisa.”<verse eid="MRK 1:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41"/>Jesu sebeli omufela amakeke, ni kolola elyoko lyaye okumulema, ni ku mwambela nji, “Ni singa, mi okene.”<verse eid="MRK 1:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42"/>Cwale ababo embingwa sebeli ibwa kwa yonyene, ni kukenisiwa. <verse eid="MRK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli omulemusa mukongota, ni kumuusa muwangu, <verse eid="MRK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44"/>ni ku mwambela nji, “Omone nji olese okwambela omunu esinjili, kono weende oka ku monahaze kwa mupulisita, obe esitabelo sowe mukukenisiwa kowe esi silaelwe kwa Mushe, kutendiwe oupaki kwaanu.”<verse eid="MRK 1:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45"/>Kono omulume woyo aba kuta sebeli otangisa okutalusa etaba eyo yolukuluhile, ni kwihasanya konje, mumukwanongeso Jesu sebeli okwangwa okwingena mu tolopo injili aanu amumwine, kono kame ana kwikalanga ku mukunda, mi aanu no kupula kame ana kutundanga mu mabaka onje, ni kwiiya kwa yonyene.<verse eid="MRK 1:45"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2"/>
  <para style="s">Jesu Yobalisa Omulume no Kukutela Olun̄an̄ali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mateu9.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luka5.17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1"/>Munyima no maywaa acana Jesu abana ukela ku Kapenauma, aanu sebeli ayupa nji kame ali mu ndoo. <verse eid="MRK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2"/>Cwale aanu no kupula sebeli aunganamo, mane sebeli akwangwa oku kwanamo konji ni ba mwelo, mi yonyene yokutaza eliywii kwa onyene, <verse eid="MRK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3"/>cwale alume anee sebeli aiya kwa Jesu ashimbile omulume no ku kutela olun̄an̄ali. <verse eid="MRK 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4"/>Kono sebeli akwangwa okusheteta kwa Jesu mulibaka no aanu okupula, mi sebeli ashuula esituwa no ndoo abo ana kwikalela Jesu niku shulumukisetamo omuseme abo ana kulangana omulume osi kukukutela olun̄an̄ali. <verse eid="MRK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5"/>Cwale Jesu aba ana kumona etumelo yoo, sebeli wamba kwa woyo osi kukutela olun̄an̄ali nji, “Mwana nge, eibi yowe na wilemenwe.”<verse eid="MRK 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6"/>Aiyeti anjili no mulawo ana kwikala omo, sebeli anahana mu micima yoo nji, <verse eid="MRK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7"/>“Uyu mulume, ngaibi aba aamba ngeesi? Kame anyefula! Woyo otwesa okulemena eibi anyine konji Nyambe yomboci!”<verse eid="MRK 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8"/>Jesu sebeli olimuka mu wangu ni mebo yaye nji kame akengeela ngeeso, mi sebeli waambela nji, “Iikene mukengeela mu micima yenu? <verse eid="MRK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9"/>Esi no kotoba ni sibine, okwambela osi kutoma olun̄an̄ali nji, ‘Eibi yowe nwilemenwe,’ ni ku mwambela nji, ‘Imana, oshimbe oulangano wowe, mi wende?’ <verse eid="MRK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10"/>Cwalehe nji mu limuke nji, Omwana no Munu kame ali ni maata bano banji no ku lemena eibi, sebeli wambela osi kukukutela olun̄an̄ali nji, <verse eid="MRK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11"/>“Kame nikwaambela nji oimane, oshimbe oulangano wowe, mi okutele ku mundi wowe.”<verse eid="MRK 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12"/>Cwale woyo sebeli oimana, mi ababo niku shimba oulangano waye nuukutela yo monwa kwaanu onje, mi sebeli akomoka onje ni ku lumba Nyambe nji, “Asimbakwatanga, katu mono etaba no ngeesi!”<verse eid="MRK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Yoisana Lebi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mateu9.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luka5.27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli ota kame ku munanga no lisa no Galileya, mi aanu no kupula onje sebeli sisheteta okuungana kwa yonyene, mi sebeli waaiyeta. <verse eid="MRK 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14"/>Mi yoenda mu ndila, sebeli omona Lebi omwana Alufeya, yo ikalile ba ofisi no mutelo, mi sebeli omwambela nji, “Onikon̄e.” Lebi sebeli oimana, niku mukon̄a.<verse eid="MRK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15"/>Mi Jesu yo ikalile ba tafule mu ndoo ya Lebi, asikutelisa no kupula na sikutenda eibi sebeli aikala naye ba tafule na iyetwa aye, kakuli aanu no kupula kame ana ku mukon̄a. <verse eid="MRK 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16"/>Cwale aiyeti no mulawo no afalisi aba ana kumona Jesu yo lya na sikutelisa na sikutenda eibi, sebeli aibanguta aiyetwa aye nji, “Iikene Omolyenu aba alya ni kunwa naanu no ngeeso?”<verse eid="MRK 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17"/>Mi cwale Jesu aba na yupa eyo, sebeli waatambula nji, “Awo ayoya wino ka saele onganga, kono kame asaelwa kwaa tomine. Kani siiya nji ni isane awo alukile, kono asikutenda eibi.”<verse eid="MRK 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Epuzo mulibaka no Oukuyumena Eilya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mateu9.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luka5.33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18"/>Cwale aiyetwa a Jowani na Falisi kame anooku yumenanga eilya, mi aanu sebeli aiya kwa Jesu niku mwibanguta nji, “Iikene aiyetwa a Jowani na Falisi aba aku yumenanga eilya, kono ikene aiyetwa owe abaka ku yumenanga eilya?”<verse eid="MRK 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19"/>Jesu sebeli waatambula nji, “Kana kame kutwesahala nji alikani no mukwati aku yumene eilya, omukwati yo sili kwa onyene? Omukwati yosili kwa onyene, kakutwesahala nji aku yumene eilya. <verse eid="MRK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20"/>Kono enako kame iiya, eyo omukwati aba sa tundisiwe kwa onyene, abohe, kame sa kuyumene eilya mu liywaa elyo.<verse eid="MRK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21"/>“Kakwisa omunu so beeka esimanahanyi no ubya ba sikumango no kukulubala, kakuli esimanahanyi no ubya mba sikaula esi no kukulubala, mane kwikezehe abono kukauka. <verse eid="MRK 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22"/>Kame kakwisa omunu so itela ewaine no ubya mu singumbuli no kupangiwa ba itumba no kukulubala, aba ku tendiwa ngeeso, ewaine no ubya kame ikaula esingumbuli sipangilwe ba situmba, mi ewaine kame isinyeha bamweya ni singumbuli sipangilwe ba situmba. Kono ewaine no ubya kame itelwa mu singumbuli sipangilwe ba situmba no ubya.”<verse eid="MRK 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Epuzo mulibaka no Liywaa no Pumulo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mateu12.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luka6.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23"/>Eliywaa linjili eli no Pumulo, Jesu yo bita mu matema no uloto na iyetwa aye alemine okucola ni kububula oubeke. <verse eid="MRK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24"/>Cwale Afalisi sebeli amba kwa Jesu nji, “Komone, aiyetwa owe ikene aba atenda esi no kwapumenenwa mu liywaa no Pumulo?”<verse eid="MRK 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25"/>Jesu sebeli waatambula nji, “Ka musibala esi sinaku tendiwa kwa Dabida, enako ana ku ulwa esi no kulya, mi yoyombile, yonyene naa ana kwikala naye? <verse eid="MRK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26"/>Omo ana kwingenena mu ndoo ya Nyambe, omupulisita omukulu yoli Abiatale, mi nolya ku inkwa ina kubeekelwa Nyambe, eyi ina kulukela okuliwa kwa pulisita feela, mane Dabida na kubako naa ana kweenda naye.” <verse eid="MRK 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27"/>Mi Jesu sebeli wekeza nji, “Eli no Pumulo kame litendelwe aanu, kasa omunu okutendelwa eli no Pumulo, <verse eid="MRK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28"/>Mihe, Omwana no Munu ni Mbumu neli no Pumulo.”<verse eid="MRK 2:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3"/>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Balisa Omulume no Kombola Elyoko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mateu12.9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luka6.6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1"/>Cwale Jesu abana kuukela kame mu Ndoo no milapelo no Majuda, mi omo kame kuna kwikalanga omulume no kombola elyoko. <verse eid="MRK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2"/>Aanu sebeli aaliketa Jesu okumona nji, kana mba mubalisa mu liywaa no Pumulo, nji awane omo no kumunungelela eyambo. <verse eid="MRK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3"/>Jesu sebeli wambela omulume no lyoko no kombola nji, “wiiye kuno ku lubala.” <verse eid="MRK 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4"/>Cwale sebeli waaibanguta nji, “Esi sipumenenwa mu liywaa no Pumulo, okutenda wino nji okutenda ouyi? Oku yoyisa omunu nji oku mwibaa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 3:4">Kono sebeli aondoka feela. <verse eid="MRK 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5"/>Cwale sebeli waaliketa onje ni miyo yo tinine ni kufilikana onene, mulibaka no micima yoo no kongola, sebeli wamba ku mulume nji, “Oolole elyoko lyowe.” Sebeli olyolola, ababo elyoko lyaye sebeli libala. <verse eid="MRK 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6"/>Ababo Afalisi sebeli atunda mu ndoo no milapelo no Majuda okalelisana nasi Heloda omo sa ibaele Jesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aanu no Kupula ku Lisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7"/>Cwale Jesu na iyetwa aye sebeli ata ku lisa no Galileya. Mi aanu no kupula sebeli amukon̄a okutunda mu Galileya, mu Judeya, <verse eid="MRK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8"/>mu Jelusalema, ku Idumeya ni mu naha na mulinjaliya no Jodani, ni mu naha ikubapile ni Tile ni Sidoni, aba ana kuyupa eyi ana tende yonje, sebeli aiya kwa yonyene. <verse eid="MRK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9"/>Mi cwale Jesu sebeli wambela aiyetwa aye nji amu lukisete owato, mulibakano aanu okupula, nji alese oku sinanisiwa. <verse eid="MRK 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10"/>Kakuli kame ana ku balisa aanu no kupula, mi cwale awo onje ana kutoma ameeti kame ana lwelanga kwa yonyene oku mulema. <verse eid="MRK 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11"/>Cwale aanu ana kwikalanga ni mebo no kwakena aba ana kumumona, sebeli akwela mu makondo aye ni kukuwa nji, “Ya wene Omwana Nyambe!”<verse eid="MRK 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli waalaela nji alese okumu limukisa.<verse eid="MRK 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu abana Kuketa Atumiwa Likumi na Yiili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mateu10.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luka6.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli ota ba lilundu nukaisana awo anaku singa onje, mi sebeli aiya kwa yonyene, <verse eid="MRK 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14"/>mi sebeli oketa ano kukwana likumi na yiili (12), awo ana kutumbiwa elitina no atumiwa, nji aikala naye ni kwatuma nji akakutaze aanu, <verse eid="MRK 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15"/>ni kwaaba amaata no kucita emebo no kwiiba.<verse eid="MRK 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16"/>Aa ana kukwana likumi na yiili (12) ana kuketa, neli Simoni uyu ona bekiwa elitina lya Pitolosi, <verse eid="MRK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17"/>anjili naa, Jakobo ni minaye Jowani ana a Zebedeya, awo, nakwabeka elitina lya Boanegesi, ninji aana no mulumo no mbula. <verse eid="MRK 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18"/>Adiliyasi ni Filipi ni Batolome ni Mateu ni Tomasi ni Jakobo omwana Alufea, Tadeya ni Simoni no Mukanana, <verse eid="MRK 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19"/>ni Judasi Sakalyote ona ku mubeteka.<verse eid="MRK 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Yoisaniwa Beeluzebule</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Mateu12.22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luka11.14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12.10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli oukela ku ndoo, mi aanu no kupula sebeli aiya kame, mane Jesu na iyetwa sebeli akwangwa okulya. <verse eid="MRK 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21"/>Mi abaaye Jesu aba ana kuyupa nji mwaali, sebeli aiya nji amushimbe, kakuli aanu nakwamba nji, “Kame apulumuka.”<verse eid="MRK 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22"/>Cwale aiyeti no mulawo aa na kutunda mu Jelusalema, ni kwamba nji, “Kame akwite amaata no Beeluzebule mwa yonyene, mi naaba acita emebo no kwiiba ni mu maata no mukulu no mebo no kwiiba.”<verse eid="MRK 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23"/>Jesu sebeli waaisana, ni kwamba noo mu nguli nji, “Satani ngaibi sa twese okucita Satani? <verse eid="MRK 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24"/>Mi omubuso aba uku futukela ookulwisa, omubuso owo kame sa ukutabe bakaci mi kautamba okwimana. <verse eid="MRK 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25"/>Na asindoo imweya aba akulwisa, endoo eyo kaitamba kwimana.<verse eid="MRK 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26"/>Cwale nji Satani kame akulwisa, nuukutaba, ka twese okwimana, kono kame satende amamaneneno aye.<verse eid="MRK 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27"/>Cwale kakwisa woyo so ingena mu ndoo no ndume no koongola, nji ashimbe einu yaye, konji aba sa tangise okununga omulume woyo no ndume, mi cwale basatwese okumushimbela einu aye.<verse eid="MRK 3:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28"/>“Niti luli kame ni myambela nji eibi yonje no aanu mba ilemeniwa, bamweya ni tinyefulo too. <verse eid="MRK 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29"/>Kono omunu yonje so nyefula Emebo No Kukena, ka tamba oku lemenwa, kono kame ali ni mubonda no sibi no kwaabwa.”<verse eid="MRK 3:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30"/>Jesu na kwamba ngeeso, kakuli aanu kame ana kwambanga nji, “Kame ali ni mebo no kwakena.”<verse eid="MRK 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Inawaye Jesu na Inaaye.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mateu12.46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luka8.19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31"/>Inawaye Jesu na inaaye sebeli akeela ni kwimana ba ndee, mi sebeli atuma omunu okamwisana mu Ndoo. <verse eid="MRK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32"/>Aanu no kupula aikalile, amu beekile mukaci. Sebeli aambela Jesu nji, “Inaowe na inoowe kame ali ba ndee, kame aku saela.”<verse eid="MRK 3:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33"/>Kono Jesu sebeli waatambula nji, “Inawange na inange anyine?”<verse eid="MRK 3:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34"/>Sebeli waliketa aanu ana kwikala naye mu Ndoo amu beekile mukaci, mi sebeli wamba nji, “Ko mumone, ainawange na inange okame aa!” <verse eid="MRK 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35"/>Kakuli omunu yonje woyo otenda esi sisingwa kwa Nyambe, yokame ominange, ni mandange ni Inawange.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4"/>
  <para style="s">Enguli no Mukuni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mateu13.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luka8.4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1"/>Jesu sebeli otangisa kame okwiyeta aanu ba likamba no lisa, mi kakuli aanu no kupula kame anaku ungana kwa yonyene, cwale sebeli oingena mu wato ni kuta mu lisa, mi aanu mu kupula koo, sebeli aikala ba likamba. <verse eid="MRK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2"/>Cwale sebeli waaiyeta eno kupula mu tinguli, mi mu tuto yaye sebeli waaiyeta nji, <verse eid="MRK 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3"/>“Komuteetete! Omukuni na kuta okakuna, <verse eid="MRK 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4"/>mi yo lemine okukuna, embuto injili sebeli ikwela mu ndila, mi otuyunyi sebeli twiiya mu kwiilya. <verse eid="MRK 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5"/>Embuto injili na ikukwela mu mumbu noku kukutela ni mawee, omo kuulwile omumbu no kupula, sebeli imena muwangu kakuli ka yasi kwingena onene mu mumbu. <verse eid="MRK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6"/>Kono eliywaa aba lishashumuka, eyi ina mene kame iletuka, mi kakuli kame yulwile emibisi, kame ikukuta. <verse eid="MRK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7"/>Einjili embuto sebeli ikwela mu mikakani, emikakani aba ikula kame iipukelisa, mi embuto sebeli yuulwa okubeeka oubeke. <verse eid="MRK 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8"/>Embuto injili sebeli ikwela mu mumbu no kuwaba, mi sebeli ikubeeka eilya no kupula, naiku mena ni koongola, mi embuto imweya sebeli ibeeka amakumi aatu, einjili amakumi mutanu ni kamweya, einjili kame sebeli ibeeka omwaanda.<verse eid="MRK 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9"/>Ku mamaneneno Jesu sebeli wamba nji, “Woyo okwite amatwi ayupe mi ayupisise.”<verse eid="MRK 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Etuso no Tinguli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mateu13.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9">Luka8.9</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 8:10">10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10"/>Ababo Jesu yoli yomboci, awo ana kwikala na iytwa aye, sebeli amwibanguta etuso no tinguli. <verse eid="MRK 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11"/>Mi sebeli waambela nji, “Anyi na mubiwi oku limuka etikunutu no mubuso wa Nyambe, kono aa ali kundee kame abeekelwe einu yonje mu tinguli. <verse eid="MRK 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12"/>Nji cwale,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">Asikumona mbamono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">kono katamba kuyupisisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">ni kuyupa ayupe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">kono alese oku yupisisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">Mane kame afanene oku siuluka, nji awane okulemenwa.’”<verse eid="MRK 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Toloka Enguli no Mukuni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mateu13.18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luka8.11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Ninji ka mu yupisisa enguli eyo? Ngaibi cwale sa mu yupisise etinguli tonje? <verse eid="MRK 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14"/>Osikukuna, woyo okuna Eliywi. <verse eid="MRK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15"/>Embuto ina kwele mu ndila kame ikufekile kanyi aanu awo ayupa eliywi kono ababo Satani kame aiya ni kulitundisa mwa onyene. <verse eid="MRK 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16"/>Aanu anjili kame akufekile kanyi embuto ina kwele ba mumbu no mawee, aba ayupa eliywi, ababo kame alitambula mu kuwabelelwa, <verse eid="MRK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17"/>mi kakwite emibisi, kono kame atundamena enako icana fela, mihe outata simba amayando aba yiiya mulibaka no Liywi, ababo kame akwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18"/>Anjili aanu kame akufekile kanyi embuto ina kwele mu mikakani, okame awo ayupa eliywi, <verse eid="MRK 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19"/>kono etipilaelo no litunga ni kongiwa ku ufumu niku lakaza einjili, aba ingena kwa onyene kame ipukutisa eliywi, mi kaibeeke embuya. <verse eid="MRK 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20"/>Kono anjili aanu kame akufekile kanyi embuto ina kuniwa ba mumbu no kuwaba, okame awo ana yupu eliywii ni kulitambula ni kubeeka embuya, embuto injili naibeeke eyi ikwana makumi aatu, injili makumi mutanu ni kamweya, einjili ikwana omwanda.<verse eid="MRK 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Elambi munji no Tubana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luka8.16-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21"/>Cwale Jesu kame sebeli wamba nji, “Aba mulita elambi kame ibeekiwa mu tubana nji munji no mumbeta, kasa okwibeeka aba ku monahala? <verse eid="MRK 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22"/>Cwale kakwisa esinu esi sishweekilwe, konji si shootolwe, simba esinu sina tendiwa ku mukunda konji siiye ba ngandaleza. <verse eid="MRK 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23"/>Nji omunu kame akwite amatwi no ku yupisa, a yupe!” <verse eid="MRK 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24"/>Mi kame sebeli waambela nji, “Mutokomele kweeyi mu yupa, omo mutendela akwenu, mwasamu tendelwe naanyi, mane niku bitelela. <verse eid="MRK 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25"/>Ku munu woyo okwite esinu sinjili mba bekelwa mukupula, kame kwa woyo ulwile, nesi ali naso mba byanguliwa simba eso alinaso.<verse eid="MRK 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Enguli omo Imenena Embuto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26"/>Jesu sebeli wamba kame nji, “Omubuso wa Nyambe kame ukufekile kanyi omunu okwaa embuto mu litema lyaye. <verse eid="MRK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27"/>Simba alangane nji atone omunji ni usiku, embuto kame ikula ni kubeeka, yo kalimukile omo ina menene.<verse eid="MRK 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28"/>Kakuli omumbu onyene kame ubeeka, oweli omutungo, okubinda omukun̄u, basa kwiiye oubeke ba mukun̄u.<verse eid="MRK 4:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29"/>Kono oubeke aba wiimba, mu nako imweya kame abeeka ecekesi, kakuli enako no kutulo nai kwana.<verse eid="MRK 4:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Enguli no Mbuto no Masitete</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31">Mateu13.31</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:32">32</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18">Luka13.18</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 13:19">19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30"/>Cwale kame sebeli wamba nji, “Siikene eso tutwesa oku faniketa ni mubuso wa Nyambe, simba ka nguli eyo satukutusise okwamba eyi? <verse eid="MRK 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31"/>Kame ikufekile kanyi embuto no Masitete, eyo aba ikuniwa mu mumbu, ni mbuto icana onene ku timbuto tonje na mu litunga, <verse eid="MRK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32"/>cwale aba ikuniwa kame ikula ni ku tenda esimena sinene okubitelela yonje eyi ikuninwe mu litema ni kubeeka emitai inene, mane cwale otuyunyi na kuwilu kame tutwesa okuyaka eiyaleto mu mwinda waso.<verse eid="MRK 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33"/>Jesu na kwasimweta amaywi mu tinguli okukumanena mukuyupisisa koo.<verse eid="MRK 4:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34"/>Ka sikwaambela okuulwile enguli, kono ku mukumda nakwa mbelanga aiyetwa aye eyambo yonje.<verse eid="MRK 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Ondota Elin̄ungwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mateu8.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luka8.22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35"/>Mu liywaa elyo, mu nako no mangolwaa, Jesu sebeli waambela nji, “Tulutelenyi mu linjaliya no lisa.” <verse eid="MRK 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36"/>Aba ana kumana okuusa aanu no kupula, aiyetwa sebeli akulonga mu wato omo ana ikalanga Jesu, ni mato anjili kwana kwikalanga. <verse eid="MRK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37"/>Mi elin̄ungwa linene sebeli liinguka, mi amandinda sebeli aiya nikufula ba wato mane ni meyi sebeli atateka okwingena mu wato, mane owato sebeli osinga okwiyala ku meyi. <verse eid="MRK 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38"/>Kono Jesu yo langanine yoli mutulo ku litusi no wato na kunyima ana kwikala yosamine ba musamo, sebeli amwingula ni kwamba kwa yonyene nji, “Mwiyeti, kaukwite taba naaba tufaa?”<verse eid="MRK 4:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli oinguka ni kukalimela emebo, ni kwambela elisa nji, “Ondoka!” Mi ababo emebo sebeli yimana, mi sebeli kwiiya okondoka kunene.<verse eid="MRK 4:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wambela aiyetwa aye nji, “Iikene aba mu cila? Mu sikwangwa okupumena ni mu nako ino?”<verse eid="MRK 4:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41"/>Aiyetwa aye sebeli acila onene, mi cwale sebeli akwambisa nji, “Uyu anyine, nji mane emebo ni lisa imu kuteke?”<verse eid="MRK 4:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5"/>
  <para style="s">Jesu abana Balisa Omulume osi Mebo no Kwakena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mateu8.28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luka8.26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1"/>Jesu na iyetwa aye sebeli akeela mulinjaliya no lisa mu sibaka no Magelaseni. <verse eid="MRK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2"/>Ababo Jesu abana kutunda mu wato, sebeli okuwana ni mulume osi mebo no kwiiba, <verse eid="MRK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3"/>uyu munu kame ana kwikalanga mu mabita, ka ku sikwikala omunu ona kutwesa okumununga simba ni mawenge. <verse eid="MRK 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4"/>Aka no kupula aba na kunungiwangwa amawenge ku makondo ni ku maoko, na kucolanga amawenge ni yoondo ku makondo aye, mi kakwisa ni munu ona kutwesa oku mubita ku maata. <verse eid="MRK 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5"/>Aka no kupula, ousiku ni munji kame ana kwikalanga mu libita ni ba malundu, yolemine okukuwa nukulemeka ku mawee.<verse eid="MRK 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6"/>Aba ana kumona Jesu yosili kule, sebeli witukela kwa yonyene, nikuka mukubamena, <verse eid="MRK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7"/>mi sebeli okuwa ni liywi linene nji, “Iikene osaela kwa mene, Wene Jesu, Omwana Nyambe? Omwambakani uli-beulu? Kame ni ku kumbela weete kwa Nyambe nji kautamba ku ni yandisa!” <verse eid="MRK 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8"/>Kakuli Jesu kame ana kwamba kwa yonyene nji, “Wene Emebo no kwiiba, otunde kwa uyu omulume.”<verse eid="MRK 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli omwibanguta nji, “Elitina lyowe tiwe anyine?” Emebo sebeli itambula nji, “Elitina lyange, time Mpi, kakuli kame tuli ano kupula!” <verse eid="MRK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10"/>Mi sebeli omukumbela onene nji, alese oku citela emebo eyo oku no kuleba ni sibaka eso.<verse eid="MRK 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11"/>Cwalehe, kame kuna kwikala omutapi munene no tingulube tinaku lyelanga kunyonga no lilundu elyo.<verse eid="MRK 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12"/>Amadimona sebeli akumbela Jesu nji, “Otupumenene okwingena mu tingulube tica, tuka ingenemo.” <verse eid="MRK 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13"/>Ababo Jesu sebeli oipumenena, mi Emebo no kwakena sebeli itunda, nukaingena mu tingulube. Ababo omutapi sebeli witukela ba lin̄ope mi sebeli umatukela mu lisa, eli lifanena okutenda eikiti yiili (2,000) mi sebeli tikwela mu lisa ni kulwela.<verse eid="MRK 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14"/>Alume no alisana sebeli acilako, mi sebeli ata mu ku simweta etaba eyo mu mundi oli beebi. Mi aanu no kupula sebeli aiya mu kumona eyi ina ku tendahala. <verse eid="MRK 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15"/>Cwale sebeli aiya kwa Jesu, ni ku mona woyo onaku yandisiwa ku Mpi no madimona, yoikalile yo kufukile mane yokuketile, sebeli acila. <verse eid="MRK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16"/>Mi awo ana kumona esisina kutendahala, sebeli ambela akoo esi sina kutendiwa kwa woyo omunu no mandimona, niku tingulube.<verse eid="MRK 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17"/>Cwale sebeli atangisa oku kumbela kwa Jesu nji atunde mu naha yoo.<verse eid="MRK 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18"/>Mi Jesu yoingena mu waato, omunu no kwingenwa ku mebo no kwiiba sebeli oiya muku kumbela nji aikale naye.<verse eid="MRK 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19"/>Kono Jesu sebeli okana niku mwambela nji, “Ute ku ndoo yowe ni kwa boowe, mi okaambele monje omo ana kutendele Ombumu, noomo ana kufele amakeke.<verse eid="MRK 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20"/>Cwale sebeli ota, ni kukatangisa okendisa eyambo yonje eyo ana mutendele Jesu mu (Dekapolisi) okutalusa nji esibaka no mindi likumi mi aanu onje sebeli akomoka onene.<verse eid="MRK 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Omwana Jailosi no Mukatana ni Mukati woyo Ona Kulema ku Mukanjo wa Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mateu9.18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luka8.40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21"/>Jesu aba na kuukela kame mu linjaliya no lisa mu wato, aanu no kupula sebeli aungana kwa yonyene ku nyonga no lisa. <verse eid="MRK 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22"/>Cwale sebeli kwiiya omunjili no akulu no sindoo no milapelo no Majuda, no litina lya Jailosi. Cwale aba anaku mona feela Jesu, sebeli okwela ku makondo aye. <verse eid="MRK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23"/>Sebeli omukumbela onene nji, “Omwanange no mukatana kame ali beebi nikufa. Wiiye, omubeeke amaoko beulu, nji abale mi ayoye.”<verse eid="MRK 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli ota naye, mi aanu no kupula onene sebeli amukon̄a amu umbelele.<verse eid="MRK 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25"/>Ababo kame kuna kwikala omukati ona kutoma oweeti no mweeya, ba myaka likumi ni yiili, <verse eid="MRK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26"/>omukati kame anaku yanda onene mukubangiwa kwa nganga no kupula, mi na kusinyehelwa onene eiluwo yaye yonje, kakwisa ni tuso ana ku mona simba icana, mane oweti waye na ukweekezeha onene. <verse eid="MRK 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27"/>Cwale omukati woyo abana kuyupa eya Jesu, sebeli okukandimeka okwingena mwaanu no kupula, abana atumela Jesu munyima, mi sebeli omulema ba sikumango saye. <verse eid="MRK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28"/>Abo sebeli okwambisa mu mucima waye nji, “Abasa nileme feele ku sikumango saye mbibala.”<verse eid="MRK 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29"/>Ababo omweeya waye sebeli wimana, mi kame ana kuyupa mu lutu lwaye nji nabala ku weeti waye. <verse eid="MRK 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30"/>Cwale ababo Jesu sebeli oyupa mukaci kaye nji amaata naatundu mwa yonyene, sebeli okutemuna mukaci no aanu no kupula ni kwamba nji, “Anyine onaleme ku ikumango yange?”<verse eid="MRK 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31"/>Aiyetwa aye sebeli amutambula nji, “Kumwine nji aanu no kupula kame akuumbelele, ngasibine aba wibanguta nji, ‘Anyine ona kuleme?”<verse eid="MRK 5:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32"/>Kono Jesu sebeli okusetuka nji amone woyo ona tende ngeeso nji anyine. <verse eid="MRK 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33"/>Omukati sebeli wiiya kwa Jesu yocilile ni kukun̄a, kakuli kame ana kulimuka esi sina kutendahala kwa yonyene, sebeli okukwiseta ku makondo aye, nikumwambela eniti yonje. <verse eid="MRK 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34"/>Jesu sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, “Mwanange no mukati, etumelo yowe nai kuyoyisa. Ote ni kozo, mi obalelele luli ku weeti wowe.”<verse eid="MRK 5:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35"/>Jesu osamba eyo, sebeli kwiiya aanu ana kutunda ku ndoo ya Jailosi, okwiiya muku mwambela nji, “Mwanowe nafu. Siikene eso okataleza Omwiyeti kame?”<verse eid="MRK 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36"/>Kono Jesu na kuulwa oku mamela amaywi awo, mi sebeli wambela Jailosi nji, “Olese kucila, kono opumene feela. <verse eid="MRK 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37"/>Mi Jesu sebeli okanisa aanu okumukon̄a, konji Pitolosi ni Jakobo, ni Jowani minaye Jakobo sebeli ata naye. <verse eid="MRK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38"/>Jesu abana kakeela ku ndoo ya Jailosi, sebeli omona aanu aimanine amaefe-efe ni kulila onene. <verse eid="MRK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39"/>Mi cwale abana ingena sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Iikene aba mwimanine amaefe-efe ni kulila? Omwana kasifa kono kame alanganine feela.<verse eid="MRK 5:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40"/>Cwale aanu sebeli amusheka, kono sebeli watundiseta bandee, sebeli oshimba sitaye ni nyinawaye nawo ana kwikalanga naye, ni kuta noo ku muzuzu oko kuna kulangana omwana. <verse eid="MRK 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41"/>Mukumu lema ku lyooko, sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, “Talita kumi” okutalusa nji, “Mwanuke munyonyo, kame namba kwa wene nji, inguka!”<verse eid="MRK 5:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42"/>Cwale ababo omwanuke sebeli oimana, mi sebeli weenda, mi kame ana kwikala ni myaka likumi ni yiili. Cwale ababo sebeli akomoka onene luli. <verse eid="MRK 5:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli walaela luli nji kuulwe omunu soyupa etaba eyo, sebeli wamba nji, omwanukana abiwe eilya.<verse eid="MRK 5:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6"/>
  <para style="s">Jesu Yokaniwa mu Nazaleta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mateu13.53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luka4.16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1"/>Jesu aba na tunda omo mu sibaka, sebeli ota ku mundi waye, mi aiyetwa aye sebeli amwenda mu nyima. <verse eid="MRK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2"/>Cwale elino Pumulo, sebeli otangisa okwiyeta aanu mu ndoo no milapelo no Majuda, mi ano kupula aba ana ku muyupa sebeli akomoka ni kwamba nji, “Kubine ana itundisa eyi wuyu mulume? Kaku shangama oko anabiwi? Kubine ana wana amaata no kutenda etimakazo ni maoko aye? <verse eid="MRK 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3"/>Kasa yokame osikwaya omwana Maliya, omukulwaa Jakobo, Jose, Juda ni Simoni? Amandaye kasaa, tuli noo? Mi kame ana sitatala mu libaka lyaye.<verse eid="MRK 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Omunuhi wa Nyambe omu aulwa okukutekiwa mu naha yaye felea, kwasi lusika lwaye na sindoo yaye.”<verse eid="MRK 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5"/>Omo kasiku twesa okutendamo omusebezi no koongola, konji okubalisa aanu acana ana kutoma, mukwabeeka amaoko aye beulu ni kwa balisa. <verse eid="MRK 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6"/>Mi kame anaku komoka okwa pumena koo.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 6:6">Jesu Yotuma Aiyetwa ana Kukwana Likumi na Yiili (12)</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mateu10.5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luka9.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Cwale Jesu sebeli ota mu mindi ili beebi yoiyeta aanu.<verse eid="MRK 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli oisana ano kukwana likumi na yiili, mi kame ana kwatuma mu wiili, mu wiili. Mi nikwaaba amaata beulu no mebo no kwakena, <verse eid="MRK 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8"/>sebeli walaela nji, “Mulese okushimba esinu sonje, konji omulamu, mulese okushimba esinkwa, omukotana, simba amali mu tipokoto tenu. <verse eid="MRK 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9"/>Mukumange einjatangwa yenu, mi mulese okushimba esikumango sinjili no wiili.” <verse eid="MRK 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10"/>Cwale kame sebeli waambela nji, “Mu ndoo yonje omo samwingene, mwikalemo okutwala aba sa mukatundemo. <verse eid="MRK 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11"/>Cwale omo mu ndoo sakane oku mitambula ni kumiyupa, mutundemo mututule amaluli ku makondo enu, otenda oupaki kwa onyene.<verse eid="MRK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12"/>Cwale sebeli ata, mukwiyeta aanu nji abake. <verse eid="MRK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13"/>Cwale sebeli acita amadimona no kupula, mi sebeli awaa amaati kwawo asikutoma no kupula, mane sebeli abala.<verse eid="MRK 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Olufu lwa Jowani Mukolobezi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mateu14.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luka9.7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14"/>Cwale Ombumu Heloda aba ana kuyupa ya Jesu, kakuli elitina lyaye naliku bubaana mi aanu sebeli aamba nji, “Jowani mukolobezi nainguka kwaafu, elibaka aba atenda etimakazo mwa yonyene.”<verse eid="MRK 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15"/>Anjili sebeli amba nji, “Yo kame Eliya,”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:15">Mi anjili nji omunuhi wa Nyambe, kanyi omunjili no anuhi a Nyambe na kukale. <verse eid="MRK 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16"/>Kono Heloda aba ana kuyupa ngeeso, sebeli wamba nji, “Yokame Jowani nina kupatula omutwi, nainguka kwaafu!” <verse eid="MRK 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17"/>Kakuli Heloda yona kutuma aanu okalema Jowani, ni kumununga okumubeka mu tolongo mulibkalya Helodiyasi omoywaa Filipi minaye, kakuli yonaku mukwata. <verse eid="MRK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18"/>Jowani kame ana kwambela Heloda nji, “Katukelo yowe okukwata omoywaa minowe!”<verse eid="MRK 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19"/>Kakuli Helodiyasi kame ana kutimba onene Jowani mi sebeli osinga oku mwibaa, kono kame ana kukwangwa omusa mwiibaele. <verse eid="MRK 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20"/>Kakuli Heloda kame ana kucilanga Jowani, mukulimuka nji mulume no kuluka, mi ni wakukena. Mi kame na ku musilelezanga. Aba ana kuyupanga yo amba, kasi kuwabelelwanga mu mucima simba nji kame ana kumu teetetanga.<verse eid="MRK 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21"/>Ku mamaneneno Helodiyasi sebeli otandala okuwana esibaka, Heloda abana kutenda omukiti no kuleiwa kwaye, mi sesbeli oisanenako amanduna no kuta yaye na kulu no masole na kulu namu Galileya. <verse eid="MRK 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22"/>Cwale omwana Helodiyasi no mukatana abana kukeela sebeli onenga onene niku wabelisa Heloda naa ana kwikala naye ba tafule. Cwale Ombumu sebeli wambela omukatana munyonyo nji, “Okumbele esi sosinge kwa mene sonje, mi mbani kubi so.” <verse eid="MRK 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23"/>Mane sebeli okununga oluci nji, “Esi so kumbele sonje, simba eseemba no mubuso wange mbani kubi. <verse eid="MRK 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24"/>Cwale omukatana sebeli ota okaibanguta inawawe nji, “Ni kumbele eikene?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:24">Inawawe sebeli omutambula nji, “Okumbele omutwi wa Jowani omukolobezi.”<verse eid="MRK 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25"/>Cwale ababo omukatana sebeli oukela kwa Mbumu muwanguwangu ni kukumbela nji, “Kame nisinga nji abano, onibe omutwi wa Jowani omukolobezi mu siwana.”<verse eid="MRK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26"/>Cwale ombumu sebeli weena onene, kono mulibaka no kweeta oluci kwaye na ngenda awo ana kwikala naye, sebeli okwangwa okumatuka amaywi aye. <verse eid="MRK 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27"/>Ababo Ombumu sebeli otuma omunjili no masole no atateleli, niku laela nji akalite omutwi wa Jowani mukolobezi. Woyo sebeli ota nukapatula omutwi wa Jowani mukolobezi mu tolongo, <verse eid="MRK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28"/>ni kulita omutwi mu siwana, ni kuuba omukatana, mi omukatana yonyene sebeli ouba inawaye. <verse eid="MRK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29"/>Cwale aiyetwa a Jowani aba ana kuyupa etaba eyo, sebeli aiiya muku shimba esitupu saye oka siteula mu libita.<verse eid="MRK 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu abana Kufepa Aanu no Kubitelela Eikiti Mutanu (5,000)</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mateu14.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka9.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Jowani6.1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30"/>Atumiwa sebeli auka kwa Jesu, oka mwambela yonje eyo ana kutenda neyi ana kwiyeta aanu. <verse eid="MRK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31"/>Cwale sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Mwiiye, tute ku mukunda muka pumuleko mbicani oku kuulwile aanu. Kakuli kame ku nakwikala aanu no kupula aa na iyanga ni kuuka mane kame ana kukwangwa ni nako no kulya.” <verse eid="MRK 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32"/>Cwale sebeli ata mu wato okaikala omboci mu sibaka no kondoka.<verse eid="MRK 6:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33"/>Cwale aanu no kupula sebeli aamona akatile, ni kwalimuka nji anyine, mi sebeli aitukelako ni makondo okutunda mu milenen̄i yonje, mi aanu sebeli aka keelako oweli Jesu na iyetwa aye asili munyima. <verse eid="MRK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34"/>Cwale Jesu aba ana kutunda mu wato, sebeli omona aanu no kupula, mi sebeli wayupela amakeke, kakuli kame ana kufeka kanyi omukoko nambulwa mulisana. Mi sebeli otangisa okwaiyeta einu no kupula. <verse eid="MRK 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35"/>Cwale eliywaa aba lina kwiika, aiyetwa aye sebeli aiya kwa yonyene ni kwamba nji, “Sino ni sibaka no kondoka, mi enako yatakale. <verse eid="MRK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36"/>Mwaa use, nji aka ku ulele eino kulya mu matema ni mu mindi ili beebi.”<verse eid="MRK 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37"/>Jesu sebeli waatambula nji, “Mwaabe eino kulya mwenyene,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:37">Onyene sebeli amwibanguta nji, “Tukaule einkwa no mali a atenda emianda yiili no muwayawaya nji twaabe alye?”<verse eid="MRK 6:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Injinga einkwa mukwite? Mute muka imone.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:38">Cwale aba anaku imona, sebeli amba nji, “Kame kuli feela einkwa mutanu ni tindi timbili.”<verse eid="MRK 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39"/>Cwale sebeli olaela nji, “Aanu onje aikale mu ikwata, ba moopu no musuhela.” <verse eid="MRK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40"/>Cwale aanu sebeli aikala banji mu ikwata, esinjili esikwata no aanu akwana omwaanda, anjili aanu ana ku kwana makumi mutanu. <verse eid="MRK 6:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41"/>Jesu sebeli oshimba einkwa mutanu ni tindi timbili, ni kwaliketa kuwilu, mi sebeli okutumela ni kupatola einkwa okuba aiyetwa aye nji atabele aanu, mi kame ni kutabela aanu etindi. <verse eid="MRK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42"/>Cwale onje sebeli alya ni kwikuta. <verse eid="MRK 6:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43"/>Cwale sebeli ashimba amatanda likumi na yiili, ana kwiyala oubulumusi no inkwa, nou no tindi. <verse eid="MRK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44"/>Mi awo ana kulya neli alume ana kukwana eikiti Mutanu (5,000).<verse eid="MRK 6:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aba na Enda ba Meyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mateu14.22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Jowani6.15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45"/>Ababo Jesu sebeli wambela aiyetwa aye nji aingene mu wato nji akutangete okuta mu linjaliya no lisa, ku Betisaida, yonyene yo suusa aanu. <verse eid="MRK 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46"/>Osimana felea okuusa aanu sebeli ota ba lilundu oka lapela. <verse eid="MRK 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47"/>Cwale enako no mangolwaa aba ina kukwana, owato owendela ba kaci no lisa, mi Jesu yoli yomboci ba likamba. <verse eid="MRK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48"/>Mi sebeli omona nji kame apuwa me aziyelehile, kakuli emebo kame ina kwalwisa onene. Mi mu nako no malungasiku, Jesu sebeli oiya kwa onyene yo enda ba meyi, mi sebeli osinga okwabitelela. <verse eid="MRK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49"/>Kono aba ana ku mumona yo enda ba meyi no lisa, sebeli akuwa onene nji ni silumba.<verse eid="MRK 6:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50"/>Cwale onje sebeli acila aba ana kumumona. Kono sebeli oleluba okwamba noo nji, “Mu koongote, ya meene, mu lese kucila.” <verse eid="MRK 6:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51"/>Cwale sebeli oku longa mu wato nonyene, mi emebo sebeli yondoka. Cwale aiyetwa aye sebeli akomoka onene. <verse eid="MRK 6:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52"/>Kakuli kasi ku yupisisa etaluso no kufepa aanu no kupula bokame abo emicima yoo kame ina koongola.<verse eid="MRK 6:52"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Balisa osi Kutoma mu Genesaleta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Mateu14.34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53"/>Cwale aba ana kumana okuluta elisa ni kuta ba likamba, mi sebeli akeela mu naha iisaniwa Genesaleta mi sebeli afuweka ku likamba. <verse eid="MRK 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54"/>Mi abana kutunda mu wato, ababo aanu sebeli amu limuka. <verse eid="MRK 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55"/>Cwale sebeli aitukela mu naha yonje ni kutangisa okalita asikutoma onje oko ana kuyupa nji Jesu kwaali. <verse eid="MRK 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56"/>Mi konje Jesu oku ana ku bita, mu mindi icana ni mu mindi inene, simba mwibaka no matema, asi kutoma kame ana kubeekiwa ba tipatelo, mi aanu kame ana kukumbela nji aa pumenene oku lema feela simba ku mungundo no sikumango saye, mi aa amulema onje kame abala.<verse eid="MRK 6:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7"/>
  <para style="s">Etuto no Alimu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Mateu15.1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1"/>Cwale Afalisi na iyeti no mulawo anjili ana kutunda mu Jelusalema, sebeli aiya ni kuungana kwa Jesu. <verse eid="MRK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2"/>Sebeli alemuha nji aiyetwa anjili a Jesu kame alya eilya ni maoko no kwakena, okutalusa amaoko nokwa yowisiwa.<verse eid="MRK 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3"/>Kakuli Afalisi, ni aanu onje no Majuda kaali, konji akuyowe oweli ku maoko, okumamela esizo no akulu, <verse eid="MRK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4"/>mi cwale naba auka okutunda ku musika, kaali konji abasa kuyowe oweli. Kusili eizo injili no kupula eyi imamela, kanyi eno kuyowisa etikomoki ni tucoo, ni injili no oukutusisa. <verse eid="MRK 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5"/>Cwale Afalisi na iyeti no mulawo sebeli aibanguta Jesu nji, “Iikene aiyetwa owe aba kayoyo ni sizo no akulu, kame alya ni maoko nokwakena? <verse eid="MRK 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6"/>Jesu sebeli waatambula nji, “Anyi asikukuba, Isaya kame ana kunuha wino eyenu kanyi omo ku n̄olelwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">Aanu aa kame ani kuteka ni tunwa too,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:6">kono emicima yoo kame ili okuno kuleba ni mene.<verse eid="MRK 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7"/>Kame ani kubamena oku nambulwa tuso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">okwiyeta koo ni kwa milawo no aanu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">kanyi ni milawo yange!’<verse eid="MRK 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8"/>Kame munasiyi etaelo ya Nyambe, mi kame mukuteka esizo no aanu.”<verse eid="MRK 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba kame kwa onyene nji, “Kame muli ni ndila noku shangama no kukana emilawo ya Nyambe, nji mongote esizo senu. <verse eid="MRK 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10"/>Kakuli Mushe kame ana kwamba nji, ‘Okuteke sitowe ni inaowe’ kame, ‘Woyo soshwaula sitaye simba inawaye, aibaiwe.’ <verse eid="MRK 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11"/>Kono kame mwamba nji omunjili aba ambela sitaye simba inawaye nji, “Etuso sa ni mi tuse ni Kolobani”, okutalusa nji esitabelo sina biwi kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="MRK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12"/>Cwale mu lese ku mu pumenena yo tenda esinjili kwa sitaye simba kwa inawaye. <verse eid="MRK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13"/>Mi kame mu mana eliywi lya Nyambe mu sizo senu esi mongotite, mi kame mu tenda einjili no kupula no ngeeso.”<verse eid="MRK 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Einu eyi itenda Omunu Okwakena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Mateu15.10-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14"/>Jesu sebeli oisana aanu no kupula kame ni kwaambela nji, “Munitetete anyi moonje, mi muyupisise. <verse eid="MRK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15"/>Ku inu ili bandee eyi ingena ku munu, kakwisa esi sitwesa oku musilafaza, kono esi situnda kwa yonyene, sokame esi simu silafaza.” [ <verse eid="MRK 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16"/>Nji omunu kame ali ni matwi no ku yupisa, ayupe.]<verse eid="MRK 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17"/>Mi cwale aba ana kusiya aanu okwingena mu ndoo, aiyetwa aye sebeli amwibanguta etaluso no nguli eyo. <verse eid="MRK 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Ninji naanyi kamu yupisisa? Kamu lemuha nji esinu sili bandee aba siingena ku munu kasimu silafaza? <verse eid="MRK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19"/>Kakuli ka siingene mu mucima waye, kono kame siingena mu lipumo, mi kame situndela bandee.” (Bokame abo ana kulaela nji eilya yonje niya kukena.)<verse eid="MRK 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba nji, “Esi situnda ku munu, so kame esi sisilafaza omunu. <verse eid="MRK 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21"/>Kakuli ni mu micima no aanu omo ku tunda emihupulo no kwiiba, outanya, oumbuyi ni kwibaa. <verse eid="MRK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22"/>Okubuka, etitakazo no inu simba amali, olunya, okoonga, okuyoya mu uhule, omuna, okooba oukukumusa ni weelo. <verse eid="MRK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23"/>Einu yonje eyi no kwiiba kame itunda mukaci mi kame isinya omunu.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Etumelo no Mukati namu Silofenisiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Mateu15.21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli otunda mo nuukutela mu sibaka sili mukaci no mulenen̄i wa Tile ni Sidoni. Sebeli oingena mu ndoo, mi ka sikusinga nji alimukiwe, kono na ku kwangwa oukushweeka. <verse eid="MRK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25"/>Kono ababo omukati ona kwikala ni mwanaye no mukatana ona kwingenwa ku mebo no kwakena, abana kuyupa eyi, sebeli wiya mu kukwela ba makondo a Jesu. <verse eid="MRK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26"/>Omukati neli Mugelike ona ku leyelwa mu Silofenisiya. Sebeli okumbela Jesu nji atundise emebo no madimona kwa mwanaye no mukatana. <verse eid="MRK 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wambela omukati nji, “Olesele oweli anukana alye eyi asinga yonje, kakufanene okushimba esilya no anukana ni kondela otumbwanana.”<verse eid="MRK 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28"/>Kono omukati sebeli otambula nji, “Ee Mbumu, simba otumbwanana munji no tafule kame tulyanga oubulumusi ou ukwa kwanukana.”<verse eid="MRK 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wambela omukati nji, “Mukutambula kowe ote emebo no madimona naitundu mwa mwanowe.”<verse eid="MRK 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30"/>Cwale omukati sebeli ota ku ndoo nukawana mwanaye yo langanine ba mumbeta, mi emebo no madimona naitundu mwa yonyene.<verse eid="MRK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Yobalisa Osusu no Sikukuma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli otunda ku Tile ni kuta ku Sidoni okushetumuka ku lisa no Galileya ni kubita mu naha no Dakapolisi. <verse eid="MRK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32"/>Mi aanu sebeli amulitela omulume no susu ni umumu ni kukumbela Jesu nji abeeke amaoko aye beulu yaye. <verse eid="MRK 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli omutwala ku nyonga, kule naanu, Jesu sebeli obeeka eminwe mu matwi no mulume. Cwale sebeli osibula amate ni kulema omulume ba lulimi. <verse eid="MRK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli waliketa ku wilu, ni kutula emebo ni kwamba kwa yonyene nji, “Effata!” Okutalusa nji, “Otikuke!”<verse eid="MRK 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35"/>Ababo amatwi no mulume sebeli atikuka, olulimi lwaye sebeli lutangisa okwamba wino. <verse eid="MRK 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli olaela aanu nji alese okwambela omunu yonje. Kono omo ana kwakaniseta, mwana ku ongoteteta okwamba etaba eyo.<verse eid="MRK 7:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37"/>Aanu kame ana ku wabelelwa ni ku komoka onene. “Kame atenda einu wino sebeli aamba. Mane kame ayupisa aanu no kwayupa, ni kwambisa awo no kwatwesa okwamba.”<verse eid="MRK 7:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8"/>
  <para style="s">Jesu abana Kufepa Aanu no Kubitelela Eikiti Inee (4,000)</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Mateu15.32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1"/>Mu maywaa awo kame aanu no kupula sebeli aungana, mi na kuulwa esi no kulya, cwale Jesu sebeli oisana aiyetwa aye ni kwaambela nji, <verse eid="MRK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2"/>“Kame nifela amakeke aa aanu no kupula, kakuli kame ana ikala ni mene ba maywaa aatu mi kakwite esi no kulya. <verse eid="MRK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3"/>Cwale nji nause ayombile ku mindi yoo, kame sa welele ba ndila kakuli anjili kame atunda oku no kuleba.”<verse eid="MRK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4"/>Cwale aiyetwa aye sebeli amwibanguta nji, “Ngasibine omunu omo sa fepele aanu ni sinkwa muno nimu lihalaupa?”<verse eid="MRK 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli waibanguta nji, “Kame mukwite einkwa ikwana bukai?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:5">Sebeli atambula nji, “Mutanu ni yiili” (7).<verse eid="MRK 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli olaela aanu no kupula nji aikale banji. Cwale sebeli oshimba einkwa mutanu ni yiili (7) nuukutumela ni kwipatola ni kuba aiyetwa aye nji atabele aanu no kupula, mi sebeli atenda ngeeso. <verse eid="MRK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7"/>Mi kame ana kwikala ni tusi tunyonyo no kucaniba, cwale sebeli otulapelela ni kulaelela nji ni tonyene otu mwaatabele to. <verse eid="MRK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8"/>Cwale sebeli alya ni kwikuta ni kutola oubulumusi ou ona kusiyalako ni kwiyata amatanda ana kukwana mutanu na yiili (7). <verse eid="MRK 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9"/>Mi aanu kame ana kukwana eikiti inee (4,000). <verse eid="MRK 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli waambela nji akutele, ababo yonyene sebeli oingena mu wato na iyetwa aye ni kuta mu sikiliti no Dalumanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Afalisi abana Kukumbela Esisupo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">Mateu16.1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11"/>Afalisi sebei aiya kwa Jesu niku tangisa okukanana naye, okumukumbela nji amonise esisupo situnda ku wilu, oku mweteka. <verse eid="MRK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12"/>Jesu sebeli otula emebo onene ni kwamba nji, “Iikene aa aanu aba asaela esisupo? Niti luli kame ni myambela nji, kakwisa esisupo sasi biwe ku lusika olu!”<verse eid="MRK 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13"/>Mi sebeli waasiya kame, ni kwingena mu wato ni kuta mu linjaliya no lisa.<verse eid="MRK 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Omumena no Afalisi nou wa Heloda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Mateu16.5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14"/>Aiyetwa kame ana kupulama okushimba einkwa konji feela simweya ana kwikala naso mu wato. <verse eid="MRK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15"/>Jesu sebeli waaba emamela nji, “Mutokomele omumena no Afalisi nou wa Heloda.”<verse eid="MRK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16"/>Cwale sebeli akwambota mukaci koo ni kwamba nji, “Kakuli katu kwite einkwa.”<verse eid="MRK 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17"/>Jesu sebeli olemuha eyi anaku kwambota ni kwaambela nji, “Iikene aba mukwambisa eyi no kuulwa esinkwa? Anyi nibano kamu mono ni kuyupa? Emicima yenu iso ngolile? <verse eid="MRK 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18"/>Kame muli ni miyo kono ka mumono? Kame muli ni matwi kono kamu yupu? Mi ka mupuluka? <verse eid="MRK 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19"/>Aba nina kupatola einkwa mutanu baanu ana kukwana eitiki mutanu, amatanda muna kutolabo kame anaku kwana babukai no ubulumusi ona kusiyalako?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:19">Sebeli atambula nji, “likumi na yiili (12).” <verse eid="MRK 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20"/>“Mi cwale aba nina kupatola einkwa mutanu ni yiili, baanu ana kukwana eikiti inee bukai amatanda mu na kutolabo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:20">Sebeli atambula nji, “Mutanu na yiili (7).”<verse eid="MRK 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21"/>Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Nibano kame kamu yupisisa?”<verse eid="MRK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Yobalisa Omulume no Kufa amiyo ku Betisaida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22"/>Cwale sebeli aiya ku Betisaida, mi aanu sebeli alita omulume no kufa amiyo, ni kukumbela Jesu nji amuleme. <verse eid="MRK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23"/>Jesu sebeli olema omulume no sibofu ni kumutundisa mu mundi. Mi cwale aba na mana okusibwela omulume amate ba miyo ni kubeeka amaoko beulu waye, Jesu sebeli omwibanguta nji, “Kame kuli eso mona?”<verse eid="MRK 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24"/>Omulume sebeli waaliketa ni kwamba nji, “Kame ni mona aanu, kono kame amonahala kanyi eitondo eyi yeenda.”<verse eid="MRK 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25"/>Cwale kame Jesu sebeli obeeka amaoko aye ba miyo no mulume. Mi omulume sebeli oukela oku mona, mi amiyo aye sebeli atateka okumona ni ku mona einu yonje wino-wino. <verse eid="MRK 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26"/>Jesu sebeli omwambela nji, “Ote ku mundi wowe, olese okuuka ku mundi ou.”<verse eid="MRK 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pitolosi Yoamba ya Jesu nji Kilesite</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Mateu16.13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luka9.18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli otunda mo na iyetwa aye, sebeli oingena mu mindi ya Filipi Sesaliya. Mi mu ndila sebeli oibanguta aiyetwa aye nji, “Aanu kame amba nji time anyine?”<verse eid="MRK 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28"/>Cwale aiyetwa sebeli atambula nji, “Anjili kame amba nji, tiwe Jowani omukolobezi, anjili nji tiwe Eliya, kono anjili kame aamba nji, kame oli omunjili no anuhi a Nyambe.”<verse eid="MRK 8:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli waibanguta nji, “Kono anyi kame mwamba nji time anyine?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:29">Pitolosi sebeli omutambula nji, “Tiwe Kilesite.”<verse eid="MRK 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli waakanisa nji alese okwambela omunu eyaye yonje.<verse eid="MRK 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Yoamba eyi no Mayando, Lifu ni Kwinguka Kwaye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Mateu16.21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luka9.22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli otangisa okwaiyeta nji omwana no munu kame alukela oku yandisiwa onene, akaniwe kwa kulu, akulu no apulisita ni kwa aiyeti no milawo. Mi aibaiwe, mi aingulwe munyima no maywaa aatu. <verse eid="MRK 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli waambela etaba eyo patalaza. Cwale Pitolosi sebeli omushimbela ku nyonga ni kumwayuta. <verse eid="MRK 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33"/>Kono Jesu sebeli okutemuna okwaliketa aiyetwa aye, sebeli wayuta Pitolosi ni kwamba nji, “Otunde kwa mene, wene Osatani,” kakuli emihupulo yowe kasa mihupulo ya Nyambe, kono ni yaanu!”<verse eid="MRK 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli oisana aanu na iyetwa aye ni kwaambela nji, “Nji omunu yonje kame asinga okunikon̄a akutobohe mi ashimbe esifapano saye anikon̄e munyima. <verse eid="MRK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35"/>Kakuli omunu yonje woyo osinga okuyoyisa omooyo waye, kame sausinyehelwe, kono woyo so sinyehelwa omooyo waye mulibaka lyange ni liywi no kuwaba, kame sayoyisiwe. <verse eid="MRK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36"/>Cwale etuso ni ibine, omunu naba sa luwe elitunga lyonje, mi yosinyehelwa omooyo waye? <verse eid="MRK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37"/>Abo siikene satende omunu nji ausetwe omooyo waye? <verse eid="MRK 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38"/>Kakuli omunu yonje woyo soneenena ni maywi ange, mu lusika olu no abuki na sikutenda eibi, Omwana no Munu ni yonyene kame samwenene aba saiye mu kanya ya Sitange ni mangeloi aye no kukena.”<verse eid="MRK 8:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Niti luli kame ni myambela, kwaali anjili aimanine bano awo katamba okufa konji abasa mone omubuso wa Nyambe abasa wiye ni maata wawo.”<verse eid="MRK 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okufutuka kwa Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Mateu17.1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luka9.28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2"/>Cwale munyima no maywaa mutanu ni limweya Jesu sebeli oshimba Pitolosi, Jakobo ni Jowani ni kwaatwala ba lilundu no kuleba , oko ano kaikala omboci mi abana kwaliketa Jesu, sebeli ofutuka balubala woo, <verse eid="MRK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3"/>mi eikumango yaye sebeli ifutuka eino likena onene mi kakwisa omunu sotwesa okuyowisa esikumango saye nji sitende elikena ngeeso. <verse eid="MRK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4"/>Cwale sebeli amona Eliya ni Moshe aamba ni Jesu. <verse eid="MRK 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5"/>Cwale Pitolosi sebeli wamba kwa Jesu nji, “Labbi, esi no kuwaba kwaaci ninji tuikalelele okuno, tuyake eitebule yaatu, esinjili sitende sowe, esinjili sa Mushe, esinjili sa Eliya.” <verse eid="MRK 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6"/>Abo kasi kulimuka esi no kwamba kakuli kame ana kucila onene.<verse eid="MRK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7"/>Cwale elikumbi sebeli liiya ni kwafuka, cwale eliywi sebeli liyupahala mu likumbi elyamba nji, “Woyo ya mwanange ni singa mumuyupe!” <verse eid="MRK 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8"/>Ababo abana kwaliketa kasi kumona aanu ana kwimana noo konji Jesu yomboci. <verse eid="MRK 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9"/>Kono abana shetumukanga okutunda ba lilundu, Jesu sebeli walaela nji alese okwambela omunu eyi ana mono, konji enako sainguke Omwana no munu kwaafu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10"/>Cwale sebeli ateula etaba eyo mu micima yoo, nu kwaambota nji okwinguka kwaafu iikene eyi italusa?”<verse eid="MRK 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11"/>Mi sebeli amwibanguta nji, “Iikene aiyeti no mulawo aba amba nji Eliya yoso ku tangeta okwiiya?”<verse eid="MRK 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12"/>Jesu sebeli waatambula nji, “Eliya kame afanene okwiiya oweli nji alukise einu yonje. Cwale iikene aba ku n̄olilwe nji Omwana no Munu kame fanene okuyandisiwa onene ni kukaniwa? <verse eid="MRK 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13"/>Kono kame ni myambela nji, “Eliya nakwiiya mi nakutenda einu yonje kwa yonyene omo ana kusingela okwiyateteta omo in̄olelwe eyaye mu man̄olo.”<verse eid="MRK 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Yobalisa Ondumbana no Mebo no Kwakena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Mateu17.14-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43a">Luka9.37-43a</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14"/>Mi cwale abana kukeela kwa iyetwa aye sebeli amona aanu no kupula na iyeti no mulawo akanana noo. <verse eid="MRK 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15"/>Cwale ababo aanu no kupula abana kumona Jesu, sebeli akomoka onene ni kumwitukela okamukeeta. <verse eid="MRK 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wibanguta aiyetwa aye nji, “Iikene eyi muna kanananga noo?”<verse eid="MRK 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17"/>Mi omunjili mukaci no aanu no kupula sebeli otambula nji, “Mwiyeti, kame nina liti mwanange kwa wene, kakuli kame akwite emebo no kwiiba katwese okwamba. <verse eid="MRK 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18"/>Aba imulemena booshe kame imukwiseta banji ni kulita olufulo ku kanwa ni kukweca amaeo ni ku kukutela. Kame ninambele aiyetwa owe nji aitundise kono na kwangwa okwitundisa.” <verse eid="MRK 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Anyi olusika no kwapumena, kame sani ikale nanyi enako ikuma babine? Kanako ikuma babine eyi samuni yupisise? Komulite ondumbana kwa mene.” <verse eid="MRK 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20"/>Mi sebeli alita ondumbana kwa Jesi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:20">Cwale emebo aba ina ku mona Jesu, ababo sebeli imukwiseta banji ni ku tundu olufulo ku kanwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21"/>Jesu sebeli wibamguta sitaye ndumbana nji, “Ba nako no kukuma babine yotoma eyi mebo no kwiiba?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:21">Mi sebeli otambula nji, “Okutundelela kuwa nukana waye. <verse eid="MRK 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22"/>Etinako no kupula emebo kame imukwesetenga mu meyi ni mulilo nji imwibae. Kono nji kame utwesa okutenda esinjili otuyupele amakeke mi otutuse.”<verse eid="MRK 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli otambula nji, “Nji kame utwesa! Einu yonje kame itwisahala ku munu woyo oli ni tumelo.”<verse eid="MRK 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24"/>Ababo sitaye omwanuke sebeli okuwa ni kwamba nji, “Kame nili ni tumelo kono icana, onituse nji niikale neyi no kupula”<verse eid="MRK 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25"/>Cwale Jesu abana mona nji aanu no kupula akeile kwa yonyene, sebeli okalimela emebo no kwakena, ni kwamba nji, “Wene emebo no umumu ni ususu, kame ni kulaela nji, otunde mwa yonyene mi olese okuukela mo kame.”<verse eid="MRK 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26"/>Cwale emebo no kwiiba sebeli ikuwa ni kumukwiseta ku makondo, emebo no kwiiba sebeli itunda. Cwale ondumbana sebeli osiyala kanyi omunu no kufa, cwale anu onje sebeli aamba nji, “Wafakale.” <verse eid="MRK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli omulema ku lyooko ni kumutusa okwimana, mi sebeli oimana.<verse eid="MRK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28"/>Cwale Jesu abana kwingena mu ndoo, aiyetwa aye sebeli amwibanguta ku nyonga nji, “Cwale iikene aci aba tuna kwangwa okutundisa emebo eyi no kwiiba?”<verse eid="MRK 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli waambela nji, “Eyi mebo no mushobo ou kaitwesiwa okutundisiwa feela konji okulapela.”<verse eid="MRK 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Yoamba Kame eyi no Lufu Lwaye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22">Mateu17.22</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 17:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43b-45">Luka9.43b-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30"/>Cwale Jesu na iyetwa aye sebeli asiya eso sibaka nikubita endila no Galileya. Mi Jesu kasi kusinga nji aanu alimuke, <verse eid="MRK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31"/>kakuli kame ana kwiyetanga aiyetwa aye ni kwambela nji, “Omwana no munu mbabekiwa mu maoko no alume amwibae, mi abasa mane okwibaiwa, munyima no maywa aatu mbainguka kwaafu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32"/>Kono kasi yupisisa eyi ana kutalusanga, mi sebeli acila oku mwibanguta.<verse eid="MRK 9:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Woyo no Kuneneba Onene Anyine?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mateu18.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luka9.46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33"/>Cwale Jesu na iyetwa aye sebeli aiya mu Kapenamu, cwale yo ikalile mu ndoo, Jesu sebeli waibanguta nji, “Iikene muna kanananga mu ndila?”<verse eid="MRK 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34"/>Kono aiyetwa aye sebeli aondoka, kakuli kame anoku kananisanga nji cwale munene ni anyine bano. <verse eid="MRK 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli oikala banji ni kwisana ano kukwana likumi na yiili ni kwamba kwa onyene nji, “Nji omunjili kame asaela okutenda uyu no weli, kame afanena okutenda ono mamaneneno ni kutenda omubika kwawo onje.” <verse eid="MRK 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli oshimba omwanuke ni kumulita mukaci koo mane ni kumwambeka ba maoko aye ni kwamba nji, <verse eid="MRK 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37"/>“Woyo yonje sotambula omwanukana mumweya kwaa anukana mu litina lyange na tambula mene, mi yonje sonitambula, kasi tambula mene, kono kame ana tambula woyo onani tumu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Woyo yonje Uulwa Okutulwisa ni Wetu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:49">Luka9.49</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 9:50">50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38"/>Cwale Jowani sebeli wamba kwa Jesu nji, “Mwiyeti, natu mono omunu ona tundisa amadimona mu litina lyowe, mi natu mukanisa kakuli kasa wetu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39"/>Kono Jesu sebeli wamba nji, “Kamufanene okumu kanisa, kakwisa omunu otwesa okutenda etimakazo mu litina lyange kame nji munyima aambe amaywi no kwiiba kwa mene. <verse eid="MRK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40"/>Kakuli omunu yonje woyo uulwa okutulwisa ni wetu. <verse eid="MRK 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41"/>Niti luli kame ni myambela nji omunu yonje somiba ekomoki no meyi nji munwe kakuli kame mupumena mwa Kilesite mbatambula omupuzo waye.<verse eid="MRK 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="s">Emiliko Mulibaka no Sibi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Mateu18.6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1">Luka17.1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 17:2">2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42"/>“Cwale mumweya nji kame atenda esino kwiiba kwawo apumena kwa mene, nji atende esibi, mba kwikala wino nji omunu woyo amunungelele eliwee linene luli mu ndingo ni kumuyumbela mu liwate. <verse eid="MRK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43"/>Nji elyoko lyowe kame liku tendisa eino kwiiba, olipatule kakuli esiwa kwa wene nukaingena mu mooyo ni lyooko limweya, kasanji okaingene ni maoko ayilii nu ukayumbelwa mu liangalilo, omulilo no kwaabwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44"/>Omo kaifi emibila yoo, nomo no kwatima omulilo. <verse eid="MRK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45"/>Mi simba nji elikondo lyowe kame likutwala mukutenda ouyi, olipatuleko, ouwa nu okaingena mu mooyo woli ni likondo limweya, kasa nji oikale ni makondo ayiili nji oka yumbelwe mu liangalilo. <verse eid="MRK 9:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46"/>Omo kaifi emibila yoo, ni mulilo no kwatima. <verse eid="MRK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47"/>Mi nji elitiyo lyowe kame likusaeseta nji otende eino kwiiba, olitundisemo, ouwa nuukaingena mu mubuso wa Nyambe ni litiyo limweya, kasa nji ni miyo ayiili nuka yumbelwa mu lyangalilo. <verse eid="MRK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48"/>Omo emibila yoo kaifu, nomo no kwaabwa omulilo.<verse eid="MRK 9:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49"/>Omunu yonje mbaka lungiwa ni mulilo (kanyi esitabelo aba sina lungiwa omungwa.)<verse eid="MRK 9:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50"/>Omungwa ni wakuwaba kono nji waamuba kale okuwaba ngasibine sausetwe okumamata kwawo kame?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:50">“Mwikale kanyi omungwa muno mwanyi mi mwikale ni kozo kwaa kwenu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10"/>
  <para style="s">Jesu Yoiyeta eyi noku Lukulula</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Mateu19.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luka16.18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli osiya esibaka eso ni kuta mu naha no Judeya ni kuta mu linjaliya ya Jodan. mi aanu no kupula sebeli aiya okuungana kwa yonyene kame, mi sebeli otangisa okwaiyeta, kakuli neli omukwa waye.<verse eid="MRK 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2"/>Cwwale Afalisi anjili sebeli aiya kwa yonyene okumweteka oku mwibanguta nji, “Kana kame kufanena nji omulume alukulule omukataye?”<verse eid="MRK 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli waatambula nji, “Ngasibine omo ana ku milaelela Mushe?”<verse eid="MRK 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4"/>Cwale sebeli atambula nji, “Mushe kame anaku pumenena omulume nji on̄olele mukataye elin̄olo no tukuluho ni kumulukulula nji akutele.”<verse eid="MRK 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5"/>Kono Jesu sebeli waambela nji, “Mushe naku min̄olela omulawo owo kakuli emicima yenu niyaku bambaba oyi. <verse eid="MRK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6"/>Kono ku matatekelo no kumbiwa elitunga, “Nyambe sebeli oumba omulume ni mukati.’ <verse eid="MRK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7"/>‘Mu libakaelyo mulume kame sasiye inawaye ni sitaye ni kwikala ni mukataye, <verse eid="MRK 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8"/>mi aanu awo ayili kame satende olutu lumweya.’ Abo kasa tinyutu timbili kono sebeli lutu lumweya. <verse eid="MRK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9"/>Cwale eso ana beeke Nyambe bamweya, mulese oku pumenena omunu okusitaba.”<verse eid="MRK 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10"/>Cwale Jesu na iyetwa aye ali mu ndoo, sebeli amwibanguta kame etaba eyo. <verse eid="MRK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11"/>Mi sebeli waambela nji, “Woyo yonje so lukulula omoyo waye ni kukwata mundina kame alwisa moyo waye mu kubuka. <verse eid="MRK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12"/>Simba nji omukati okukana mbumwaye nji akwaliwe kundina kame abuka.”<verse eid="MRK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Yofuyola Anuke Anyonyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mateu19.13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luka18.15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13"/>Cwale aanu sebeli alita anukana kwa Jesu nji aafuyaule, kono aiyetwa sebeli aayuta. <verse eid="MRK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14"/>Cwale Jesu abana mona ngeeso, sebeli otina ni kwamba kwa onyene nji, “Komulesele anuke anyonyo aiye kwa mene, kakuli omubuso wa Nyambe niwoo. <verse eid="MRK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15"/>Niti luli kame nimyambela nji, omunu yonje nji katambula omubuso wa Nyambe kanyi mwanuke, katamba okuwingena.” <verse eid="MRK 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16"/>Mi Jesu sebeli waashimba nikwabeeka ba maoko mane ni kwafuyaula okubeeka amaoko aye beulu yoo.<verse eid="MRK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Omulume no Kufuma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mateu19.16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luka18.18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17"/>Cwale Jesu abana tateka okwenda omwendo waye, sebeli kwiiya omulume yoitukela kway onyene ni kukwela ku makondo aye okukubama balubala lwaye ni kumwibanguta nji, “Weene omwiyeti no kuwaba, ngasibine sa nitende nji ni kawane omooyo no kwaabwa?”<verse eid="MRK 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli otambula nji, “Iikene oniisanena nji mbili wa kuwaba? Kakwisa uyu no kuwaba konji Nyambe yomboci. <verse eid="MRK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19"/>Olimukile emilawo, olese kwibaa , olese kubuka, olese kwiita, olese okupaka einu no mapwa, olese okoonga omukowe nji omubyangule esinu saye mi cwale okuteke inaowe ni sitowe.<verse eid="MRK 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20"/>Omulume woyo sebeli otambula nji, “Mwiyeti, eyi yonje kame nii mamele okutunda ku undumbana wange.”<verse eid="MRK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21"/>Jesu sebeli omwaliketa niku musinga ni ku mwambela nji, “Kosili esinu simweya onasiyi. Cwale ote okaulise oufumu wowe wonje cwale otabele awo ashebile, mbuwana oufumu kuwilu mi cwale wiiye onikon̄e.” <verse eid="MRK 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22"/>Omulume abana yupa ngeeso, sebeli okomoka ni kweena onene kakuli kame ana kwikalanga ni ufumu no kupula.<verse eid="MRK 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli waliketa oku noku ni kwamba kwa iyetwa aye nji, “Ngasibine kubambabile nji afumi aka ingene mu mubuso wa Nyambe!”<verse eid="MRK 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24"/>Cwale aiyetwa sebeli akomoka onene amaywi aye. Kono Jesu sebeli wamba kame nji, “Anaange, kame ku bambabile ngaibi nji awo asepile oufumu akaingene mu mubuso na ku wilu! <verse eid="MRK 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25"/>Kwakotoba ekamele okwingena mu litiyo no Ndonga okubita omunu no kufuma okwingena mu mubuso wa Nyambe.”<verse eid="MRK 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26"/>Aiyetwa aye sebeli akomoka onene, nuukwambota nji, “Cwale anyine so kayoisiwa?”<verse eid="MRK 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27"/>Jesu sebeli waaliketa ni kwamba nji, “Kwaanu kame ku pala, kono kwa Nyambe kame kutwesahala, einu yonje kame itwesahala kwa Nyambe.”<verse eid="MRK 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28"/>Cwale Pitolosi sebeli wamba kwa Jesu nji, “Omone, na tusiyi einu yetu yonje okukukon̄a.”<verse eid="MRK 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29"/>Jesu sebeli wamba nji, “Niti luli kame ni myambela, kakwisa omunu ona siyi endoo, simba amandaye, inawaye, sitaye, anaaye, amatema mulibaka lyange ni liywi no kuwaba, <verse eid="MRK 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30"/>woyo so kwangwa okutambula omwanda muno mu nako ino, etindoo, amandaye, inawaye, aana ni matema, niku yandisiwa mba tambula omooyo no kwabwa mu nako iiya. <verse eid="MRK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31"/>Kono aanu no kupula no weli asaikale ku mamaneneno, anaku mamaneneno asa ikale ano weli.”<verse eid="MRK 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Yoamba eyi no Lufu Lyaye Aka no Waatu.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mateu20.17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luka18.31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32"/>Cwale Jesu na iyetwa aye sebeli akambamena ku Jelusalema, Jesu yo twaletete aiyetwa aye ku lubala, mi aiyetwa sebeli akomoka okumona aanu awo ana ku mukon̄a acilile. Kame sebeli oshimbela ana kukwana likumi na yiili kunyonga ni kwaambela eyo saikatendahale kwa yonyene. <verse eid="MRK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33"/>Jesu sebeli waambela nji, “Muteetete, kame tukambamena ku Jelusalema, Omwana no munu kame akabiwa mu maoko no apulisita akulu na iyeti no mulawo, mba mwatulele elifu ni ku mubeeke mu maata ano macaba, <verse eid="MRK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34"/>mi awo kame samu shubaule ni ku musibwela amate, okumushapa ni ku mwibaa, mi munyima no maywaa aatu mba inguka kame.”<verse eid="MRK 10:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okukumbela kwa Jakobo ni Jowani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Mateu20.20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35"/>Cwale Jakobo ni Jowani aana a Zebedia, sebeli aiya kwa Jesu ni ku mwambela nji, “Mwiyeti, kame tusinga nji otutendele eyo tukukumbela.”<verse eid="MRK 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli waibanguta nji, “Iikene musinga nji nimi tendele?”<verse eid="MRK 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37"/>Sebeli amutambula nji, “Otupumenene nji aba so ikale mu kanya yowe, tukwikale omunjili nwaci ku silyo sowe omunjili ku simoo.”<verse eid="MRK 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38"/>Kono Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Kamu limukile esi mu kumbela. Kame samutwese okunwena mu sinweno sani nwene? Simba oku kolobezwa ni kolobezo sani kolobeziwe?”<verse eid="MRK 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39"/>Cwale sebeli amutambula nji, “Kame tutwesa.” Mi Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Kame sa mu nwene mu sinweno sa ni nwene, ni ku kolobeziwa ni kolobezo sa ni kolobeziwe, <verse eid="MRK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40"/>kono okwikala ku lyoko lyange no silyo simba kweli no simoo, kasa mene sa nimiba, kono kame sa ku biwe kwawo ana lukisetwe ngeeso.”<verse eid="MRK 10:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41"/>Mi cwale aiyetwa no kukwana likumi aba ana kuyupa okukumbela oko, sebeli atinena Jakobo ni Jowani. <verse eid="MRK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli waaisana ni kwaambela nji, “Kame mulimukile nji aa aliketiwa nji ambumu no sicaba, kame atenda abika oo, mi akulu kame aendisa ni maata oo. <verse eid="MRK 10:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43"/>Kono kwaanyi kakutamba kwikala ngeeso, kono woyo yonje osinga okutenda omunene kwaanyi, atende omubika wenu, <verse eid="MRK 10:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44"/>mi omunu yonje mwaanyi woyo osinga okutenda uyu no weli, atende omubika wenu moonje. <verse eid="MRK 10:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45"/>Kakuli Omwana no munu kasiiyela nji abelekelwe, kono ninji abeleke mi abe omooyo waye nji aliulula aanu no kupula.”<verse eid="MRK 10:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Yobalisa Esibofu siisaniwa Batimeya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mateu20.29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luka18.35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46"/>Cwale sebeli aiya mu Jeliko, mi Jesu abana tunda mu Jeliko na iyetwa aye, naanu no kupula, Batimeya omukumbeli no sibofu omwana Timeya, yo ikalile kunyonga no ndila. <verse eid="MRK 10:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47"/>Mi cwale abana kuyupa nji Jesu no Nazaleta, sebeli otangisa okukuwa nji, “Jesu, wene omwana Dabida, oni yupele amakeke.”<verse eid="MRK 10:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48"/>Mi aanu no kukupula sebeli amwayuta nji aondoke, kono sebeli okuwa onene nji, “Wene omwana Dabida oni yupele amakeke!”<verse eid="MRK 10:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli oimana ni kwamba nji, “Mu mwisane.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:49">Sebeli aisana esibofu nji, “O koongote, oimane, kame akwisana.”<verse eid="MRK 10:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50"/>Yonyene sebeli oyumba olwambi aye, ni kwimana ni makondo, mi sebeli oiya kwa Jesu.<verse eid="MRK 10:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli omwambela nji, “Siikene osinga nji niku tendele?” Esibofu sebeli sitambula nji, “Molyange, ni biwe okumona.”<verse eid="MRK 10:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, “Ote, etumelo yowe naiku balisa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:52">Ababo sebeli obiwa okumona, mi sebeli okon̄a Jesu mu mukwakwa.<verse eid="MRK 10:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11"/>
  <para style="s">Jesu abana Ingena mu Jelusalema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mateu21.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka19.28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Jowani12.12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1"/>Cwale Jesu na iyetwa aye aba anaku keela ku nyonga no Jelusalema, ku mindi no Betefage ni Beteni, ba Lilundu lya Olibe, Jesu sebeli otuma aiyetwa aye ayiili, <verse eid="MRK 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2"/>ni kwaambela nji, “Mute mu mundi oli balubala lwenu, mi ababo musiingena feela mu mundi omo mba muwana akambongolo kanungilwe, aka kakasiikaliwa kale omunu, mukanungutule mu kalite kuno. <verse eid="MRK 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3"/>Nji omunu kame sa miibangute nji, Iikene aba mutenda ngesi? Mwambe nji, ‘Ombumu kame akasaela mi kame tukausa abano.” <verse eid="MRK 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4"/>Mi sebeli ata, nuukawana akambongolo akanungilwe ku mwelo mu ndila, mi sebeli akanungutula. <verse eid="MRK 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5"/>Cwale awo ana kwimananga oko sebeli amba kwa onyene nji, “Iikene mutenda, aba munungutula akambongolo?”<verse eid="MRK 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6"/>Mi awo sebeli aambela eyo Jesu ana kwaambela, mi sebeli aapumenena okuta. <verse eid="MRK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7"/>Cwale aiyetwa sebeli alita akambongolo kwa Jesu, ni kubekabo eikumango yoo beulu no kambongolo, mi Jesu sebeli oikalabo. <verse eid="MRK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8"/>Mi aanu no kupula sebeli ayala eikumango yoo mu ndila, anjili sebeli ayala amamuna no mitayi no itondo ana kutema mu matema. <verse eid="MRK 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9"/>Mi awo ana kwendanga ku lubala naawo ana kwendanga munyima kame ana kukuwelezanga nji, “Hosana! Kulumbekwe woyo okeyile mu litina lya Mbumu! <verse eid="MRK 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10"/>Kulumbekwe omubuso wa Sitetu Dabida owo okeyile! Hossana mu wilu naku wilu!” <verse eid="MRK 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11"/>Jesu abana ingena mu Jelusalema, sebeli ota mu Ndoo ya Nyambe, mi abana kumana okumonamo einu yonje, abana kumona nji kwaika kale, sebeli ota mu Beteniya na iyetwa aye likumi na yiili (12).<verse eid="MRK 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu abana Kukuta Esitondo no Mukuyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18">Mateu21.18</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 21:19">19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12"/>Eliywaa linjili, abo Jesu na iyetwa aye akatundelele ku Beteni, sebeli oyomba. <verse eid="MRK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13"/>Jesu yo sili aba no kuleba sebeli omona esitondo no mukuyu, sebeli otako okamona nji nakubekiwa esino kulya, mi kasikuwanako esinjili kono konji amamuna feela aliko, kakuli kayasi kukukwana enako no mukuyu. <verse eid="MRK 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli waambela esitondo nji, “Kuulwe omunu solya kame ku mbuya yowe.” Na iyetwa aye ayupetete eyi aamba.<verse eid="MRK 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Yota mu Ndoo ya Nyambe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mateu21.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luka19.45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Jowani2.13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15"/>Cwale aba ana kukeela mu Jelusalema, Jesu sebeli oingena mu Ndoo ya Nyambe ni kutangisa okucita asikuulisa naa asikuula, ni kukwisa etitafule no asikucinca amali ni ipula no asikuulisa otunkwilimba, <verse eid="MRK 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16"/>mi Jesu kasiku pumenena omunu yonje okubita mu Ndoo ya Nyambe yoshimbile esinu. <verse eid="MRK 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli waaiyeta ni kwaambela nji, “Kaku sin̄oliwa nji, ‘Endoo yange kame saisaniwe nji ndoo no milapelo no aanu onje? Kono aanyi namwifutula amakundamo no ambuyi.”<verse eid="MRK 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18"/>Cwale apulisita akulu na iyeti no mulawo abana kuyupa eyi, sebeli asaela omo sa ibaele Jesu, kono kame anaku mucila kakuli kame kuna kwikala aanu no kupula ana kukomoka etuto yaye.<verse eid="MRK 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19"/>Cwale aba kuna kwiika, Jesu na iyetwa aye sebeli atunda mu mulenen̄i.<verse eid="MRK 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Etuto okutunda ba Sitondo no Mukuyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Mateu21.20-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20"/>Eliywaa lina kutatamako amasiku alemine okwenda, sebeli amona esitondo no mukuyu esikukutile sonje kutangisa ku mamuna okutwala niku mibisi yaso. <verse eid="MRK 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21"/>Cwale Pitolosi sebeli opuluka eyi ina kutendahala ni kumwambela Jesu nji, “Omone, Mwiyeti, esitondo ona kukuta nasi kukuta.”<verse eid="MRK 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli waatambula nji, “Mu pumene kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="MRK 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23"/>Niti luli kame ni mwiambela nji, woyo yonje so ambela elindu eli nji, ‘Otunde aba okaku kondele mu liwate,’ mi kame atenda yokashungula mu mucima waye, kono kame apumena nji eyi aamba kame itwesa okutendahala, mba itendahala kwa yonyene. <verse eid="MRK 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24"/>Cwalehe kame ni myambela nji, “Einu yonje sa mukumbele mu tapelo, mupumene nji namwibiwi mi mbaitende yenu.” <verse eid="MRK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25"/>Mi aba mwimana okulapela, mu lemene oweli akwenu anami foseze nji kwaali, nji cwale sitenu na kuwilu atwese okumi lenena emibonda yenu naanyi.” [<verse eid="MRK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26"/>Kono cwale aba kamwa lemene, Sitenu na kuwilu katamba okumi lemena emibonda yenu.]<verse eid="MRK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Epuzo mulibaka no Maata a Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mateu21.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luka20.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27"/>Cwale sebeli aukela kame ku Jelusalema, Jesu yoenda mu Ndoo ya Nyambe, apilisita akulu na iyeti no mulawo na kulu sebeli aiya kwa yonyene, <verse eid="MRK 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28"/>mi sebeli aibanguta Jesu nji, “Otwambele amaata otenda nawo einu eyi? Anyine ona kubi amaata awo nji otende eyo?”<verse eid="MRK 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29"/>Jesu sebeli waatambula nji, “Kame sa nimiibanguta epuzo, nji kame sa muni tambule, ni mene mbani mitalusete amaata ni tenda nawo einu.<verse eid="MRK 11:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30"/>Ekolobezo ya Jowani kame ina kutunda kwa Nyambe nji ku munu? Muni tambule.”<verse eid="MRK 11:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31"/>Sebeli atangisa oukukananisa onyene nji, “Abasa twambe nji kame itunda kwa Nyambe,’ yonyene kame saambe nji, ‘Iikene, cwale, aba ka mwasiku pumena Jowani?’ <verse eid="MRK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32"/>Kono aba sa twambe nji, ‘Kame ina kutunda kwaanu,’” abohe kame ana kucila aanu no kupula kakuli aanu kame anaku pumena nji Jowani neli munuhi wa Nyambe. <verse eid="MRK 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33"/>Cwale sebeli atambula Jesu nji, “Katu yii.” Cwale Jesu sebeli waambela nji, “Ni mene kani myambele amaata ni tendisa nawo einu.”<verse eid="MRK 11:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12"/>
  <para style="s">Enguli no Abeleki mu Litema no Beine</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mateu21.33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luka20.9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli otateka okwamba kwa onyene mu tinguli nji, “Kame kuna kwikalanga omulume munjili woyo ona kukuna elitema lyaye, mi sebeli obeeka olukwakwa okutingulusa elitema lyonje, ni kutombola owina nji abeeke mo ewaine mane ni kuyakabo etawala mi sebeli olisiyela alimi nji alimangemo ni kuta omwendo waya mu naha indina. <verse eid="MRK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2"/>Cwale enako aba ina kukwana no kukutula, sebeli otumako omubeleki waye kwa limi nji akashimbe ku timbuya na mu litema. <verse eid="MRK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3"/>Mi sebeli amu shimba ni kumufula ni kumucita mane ni kumuusa youlwile esi ana kushimba. <verse eid="MRK 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4"/>Kame sebeli otumako omubeleki mundina mi ni yonyene sebeli aka mulemeka mu mutwi, ni kumwenisa onene. <verse eid="MRK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5"/>Cwsale sebeli otumako omunjiili kame, cwale woyo sebeli akamwibaa. Kame sebeli otumako ano kupula anjili sebeli akafuliwako anjili okwibaiwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6"/>Ku mamaneneno sebeli omutumako mwanaye ana kusinga onene ni kwamba nji, ‘Uyu mbaka mukuteke kakuli ni mwanange.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7"/>Kono alimi sebeli akwaambela mukaci koo nji, ‘Uyu yoshwana okeile muya yo mwanaye omunya litema, twendenyi tu mwibae cwale nji oufumu waye utende wetu!’ <verse eid="MRK 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8"/>Cwale sebeli amulema ni kumwibaa ni kuyumbela esitupu saye kundee no litema no beine.<verse eid="MRK 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli waibanguta nji, “Iikene satende omunya litema? Mba iyi mukwiibaa alimi awo ni kubeeka elitema mu maata no anjili. <verse eid="MRK 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10"/>Kana kamwa sibala Elin̄olo eli?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">“Eliwee ana kukana ayaki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:10">nali futuka okutenda eli no tuso onene ku mawee onje?<verse eid="MRK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11"/>Uyu neli Mbumu woyo ona kutenda ngeeso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:11">mi kome ikomokisa mu miyo etu!’”<verse eid="MRK 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12"/>Cwale sebeli aeteka nji amununge, kono sebeli acila aanu, kakuli nakulimuka nji kame amba eyi nguli okwa lwisa, cwale sebeli amusiya nukutela.<verse eid="MRK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Epuzo mulibaka no Kuteneka Emitelo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mateu22.15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luka20.20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13"/>Cwale sebeli atuma kwa yonyene Afalisi anjili ni kalulo injili no anu a Heloda nji aka muswase mu etipuzo. <verse eid="MRK 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14"/>Mi sebeli aiya ni kwamba kwa yonyene nji, “Mwiyeti, tulimukile nji kame wambanga eniti, mi kaukwite etaba neyo aamba aanu, mi kukwite taba nomo aikalele omunu, kono kame osimweta etato ya Nyambe kwaanu. Kana naku pumenenwe okuteneka omutelo kwa Sizale nji kakwa sipumenenwa?<verse eid="MRK 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15"/>Twaa teneke nji tulese kuteneka?” Kono Jesu mulibaka no kukuba koo, sebeli waatambula nji, “Iikene aba muneteka? Komu nilitele amali no muwayawaya nji nimonebo.”<verse eid="MRK 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16"/>Sebeli amulitela imweya, mi sebeli waibanguta nji, “Esifateho ni litina ilibo aba niyaa nyine?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:16">Sebeli amutambula nji, “Ya Sizale.”<verse eid="MRK 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Mube Sizale ya Sizale, ni kwa Nyambe ya Nyambe”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:17">Cwale sebeli akomoka onene okutambula kwaye.<verse eid="MRK 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Epuzo mulibaka no Kwinguka kwaafu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mateu22.23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luka20.27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18"/>Cwale Asaduki sebeli aiya kwa yonyene amba nji omunu abaafa kakwisa okwinguka, mi sebeli aiya kwa yonyene ni kumwibanguta nji, <verse eid="MRK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19"/>“Omwiyeti, Mushe nakutu n̄olela okwamba nji, Mukulowe abaafa mi kame asiya mukataye yokakwite omwana, minaye simba mukulwaye no mulume akwate woyo mukataye nji aleyeleko mukulwaye simba minaye aana.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20"/>Nakukwikalanga andumbana no kukwana mutanu na yiili, omweeli sebeli okwata mukataye, mi cwale abana kufa kasikusiya omwana, <verse eid="MRK 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21"/>cwale ondundamweli sebeli okwata woyo mukati mi niyonyene sebeli ofa oku nambulwa omwana, mi sebeli kutendahala ngeeso nikwa woyo no waatu. <verse eid="MRK 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22"/>Mi onje mutanu na yiili naku mukwata kono sebeli afa oku nambulwa aana, mane kumamaneneno ni mukati sebeli ofa. <verse eid="MRK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23"/>Cwale abo abasa inguke onje, anyine so tenda omunya mukati? Kakuli onje mutanu na yiili naku mukwatanga.”<verse eid="MRK 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24"/>Jesu sebeli waibanguta nji, “Kamu limukile nji namufoso? Kakuli kamuyii aman̄olo ni maata a Nyambe. <verse eid="MRK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25"/>Abo cwale ano kufa abasa inguke kakutamba kwikala okukwata simba okukwalwa kono mbafeke kanyi amangeloi mu liwilu. <verse eid="MRK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26"/>Cwale kweyi no kwingulwa kwafu, kamwa sibala mu buka ya Mushe, mu mubamba ou wamba eyino siputa, omo ana kwambelela Nyambe kwa yonyene nji, “Time Nyambe wa Abulahama Nyambe wa Isaka mane ni Nyambe wa Jakobo.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27"/>Kasa Nyambe wawo no kufa kono Nyambe wawo asikuyoya. Na mufoso!”<verse eid="MRK 12:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Etaelo Inene Onene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Mateu22.34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luka10.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28"/>Cwale omunjili no aiyeti no mulawo na kwikalako abaana kukananisanga. Mi nakumona nji Jesu naatambula wino, ababo sebeli oiya kwa yonyene ni kumwibanguta nji, “Ibine etaelo inene ku titaelo tonje?”<verse eid="MRK 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29"/>Jesu sebeli otambula nji, Etaelo inene ino, “Oyupe, weene Isilaele! Ombumu Nyambe wetu ni mumweya. <verse eid="MRK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30"/>Osinge Ombumu Nyambe ni mucima wowe wonje, ni mooyo wowe wonje, ni tingana towe mane ni maata owe onje.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31"/>Eyi no wiili ino, ‘Osingi woyo oyakile naye kanyi omo okusingela weenyene.’ Kakwisa etaelo inene okubita eti.” <verse eid="MRK 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32"/>Cwale omwiyeti no mulawo sebeli wambela Jesu nji, “Kame wamba eniti, Mwiyeti! nwamba eniti aba wamba nji ni mumweya mi niyonyene feela kakwisa mundina. <verse eid="MRK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33"/>Mi muku musinga onene ni mucima wowe wonje, mane muku yupisisa kowe konje ni maata onje, ni kusinga omukowe kanyi omo okusingela weenyene, ni yautokwa onene okubita etinubu no kucin̄a ni itabelo.”<verse eid="MRK 12:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34"/>Cwale Jesu abaana mona nji natambula mukushanganma, sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, “Kauli oku no kuleba ni mubuso wa Nyambe.” Mi munyima no eyo, kakwisa woyo no kuba okumwibanguta epuzo yonje.<verse eid="MRK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Epuzo mulibaka lya Mwanaa Dabida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mateu22.41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luka20.41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35"/>Cwale abo Jesu abana iyetanga mu Ndoo ya Nyambe, sebeli wibanguta nji, “Cwale ngasibine aiyeti no mulawo aba amba nji Kilesite ni mwanaa Dabida? <verse eid="MRK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36"/>Dabida yonyene yokame ona kwamba ni Mebo No Kukena nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">‘Ombumu naamba kwa mbumu wange nji,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">Oikale ku lyoko lyange no silyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">konji aba sani beeke esiila senu ku nji no makondo enu.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37"/>Dabida yonyene luli kame amwisananga nji Mbumu, cwale Kilesite ngasibine satende mwanaye Dabida?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Mi aanu no kupula kame ana kumuyupa wino.<verse eid="MRK 12:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yoba Emamela mulibaka no Aiyeti no Mulawo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mateu23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luka20.45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38"/>Cwale mukusimweta kwaye sebeli wamba nji, “Mumamele eyi no aiyeti no mulawo, ao asinga okuta mu tindila ni tinyambi no kuleba, mane ni kubiwa elikute mu ibaka no misika, <verse eid="MRK 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39"/>ni kwikala ba ipula no kuwaba mu tindoo no milapelo mane ni ibaka no kuwaba ba nako no mikiti, <verse eid="MRK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40"/>aa kame alyela etimbakati einu yoo mulibaka no kwatendela etitapelo no kuleba. Mba tambula ekoto yoo inene.<verse eid="MRK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Enubu no Mbakati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41"/>Cwale sebeli okaikalela abeebi ni sibaka no tinubu okumona omo ana kubeekelanga amali aanu mu siwana no tinubu. Afumi no kupula alemine okuyumbelanga amali no kupula mu iwana. <verse eid="MRK 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42"/>Mi cwale ombakati no kusheba ni yonyene sebeli oiya, ni kuyumbela mo otupene twiili no muwayawaya. <verse eid="MRK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli oisana aiyetwa aye ni kwamba kwa onyene nji, “Niti luli kame nimyambela nji, uyu mbakati no kusheba na beeke okubita onje alemine okubeeka amali mu siwana no tinubu. <verse eid="MRK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44"/>Kakuli anjili kame atundisa abo bali esinjili, kono woyo yonyene kame ana tundisa abo kuulwile, kame nabi abo ayoyela omooyo waye wonje.”<verse eid="MRK 12:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13"/>
  <para style="s">Jesu abana Kwamba eyi no ku Shandola Endoo ya Nyambe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1">Mateu24.1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5">Luka21.5</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 21:6">6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1"/>Cwale Jesu abana kutunda mu Ndoo ya Nyambe, omunjili no aiyetwa aye sebeli wamba nji, “Mwiyeti! Komone, ouwa no mawee ni miyako eyi!”<verse eid="MRK 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2"/>Mi Jesu sebeli omutambula nji, “Wimwine emiyako inene? Kwa onyene kakwisa eliwee lyulwile okulema ba liwee elinjili, elisa lisiiwe okutwisetwa banji.”<verse eid="MRK 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Outata niku Yandisiwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mateu24.3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luka21.7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3"/>Cwale Jesu yoikalile ba lilundu no itondo no olibe, amabapa ni ndoo ya Nyambe, Pitolosi, Jacobo, Jowani ni Adiliyasi sebeli aiya kwa yonyene ku mukunda ni kumwibanguta nji, <verse eid="MRK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4"/>“Otwambele, kamwaka saika monahalele eyo,” mi kame otwambele eisupo saitendahale okutumonisa nji enako yakeela kale nji okutwa iiye einu yonje?”<verse eid="MRK 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli otangisa okwaambela nji, “Mutokomele nji omunu alese okumyoonga. <verse eid="MRK 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6"/>Aanu no kupula kame saiye mu litina lyange, aambe nji, Time Kilesite! mi kame saonge aanu no kupula. <verse eid="MRK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7"/>Mi cwale aba samuyupe emilumo no tindwaa abeebi, ni lin̄usa no tindwaa kule, mule kucila, kame ifanena yonje okumonahala, kono kakutalusa nji amamaneno aawo. <verse eid="MRK 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8"/>Kakuli esicaba sinjili mbasi lwisi esinjili, mi omubuso munjili olwise omunjili, ezikinyeho mba imoniwa mu litunga, mu mabaka no kupula, ni lukupwe ngeeso, eyo kame saitende feela kanyi amatatekelo no mayando.<verse eid="MRK 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9"/>“Kono anyi mutone. Kakuli kame samunungiwe ni kutwaliwa ku tikuta, niku mifula mu ndoo no milapelo, kame samutwaliwe balubala no abusisi na Mbumu mulibaka lyange mukatende etipaki tange kwa onyene. <verse eid="MRK 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10"/>Kono eliywi no kuwaba kame lifanena okukutaziwa kwaanu onje. <verse eid="MRK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11"/>Mi cwale aba samileme ni kumitwala ku kuta mulese kubilaela neyo samwambe, kono mwaambe eyi samubiwe okwamba mu nako eyo. Kakuli kasa anyi asambe, kono ni Mebo No Kukena. <verse eid="MRK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12"/>Mandaye munu kame sabeteke mandaye nji aibaiwe. Sitaye munu atende ngeeso kwa mwanaye. Aana kame safutukele asitoo ni kwaaibaa. <verse eid="MRK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13"/>Omunu yonje kame samitimbe mulibaka no litina lyange. Kono woyo sotundamena okutwala ku mamaneneno mba yoyisiwa.<verse eid="MRK 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ouyi owo Usilafaza Endoo ya Nyambe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Mateu24.15-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luka21.20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14"/>Kono cwale abasa mumone ouyi ou usilafaza nji kame oli aba no kwafanena, (omubali ayupisise) abohe aali mu Jundeya, aitukele ku malundu. <verse eid="MRK 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15"/>Woyo oli ba situwa no ndoo yaye alese okutundabo nji aingene mu ndoo ashimbemo simba sinu simweya. <verse eid="MRK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16"/>Mi kame woyo oli mu litema alese okuuka ku mundi nji akashimbe omukanjo waye. <verse eid="MRK 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17"/>Kono oumayi kame sawikale kwakati awo sawaniketwe akushimbile ni kuyamwisa otumbututu. <verse eid="MRK 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18"/>Mulapele kwa Nyambe nji einu eyi ilese okutendahala omubebo. <verse eid="MRK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19"/>Kakuli omo mu maywa awo en̄alelwa kame sainenebe. Okutunda ku matatekelo elitunga abana kulyuumba Nyambe, okulita bano, kakusi moniwa en̄alelwa inene ngeeso, mane ni ku lubala kaitamba kumonwa. <verse eid="MRK 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20"/>Mi kwaulu Ombumu apatule kumaywaa awo kambe kakwisa omunu yonje soka yoyisiwa, kono mulibaka no aketwa, awo ana kuketa, napatula ku maywaa.<verse eid="MRK 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21"/>“Nji cwale omunu kame amyambela nji, Komumone, Kilesite uno yokame kuno simba nji komumone uya yokame mulese okupumena.” <verse eid="MRK 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22"/>Asi Kilesite no mapwa na nuhi no mapwa mbaku monahaza, ni kutenda etiponiso ni timakazo nji kame kutwesahala naawo ana isaniwa. <verse eid="MRK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23"/>Kono mutokomele, kame nina kumilemusa eyambo eyo yonge ba weli.<verse eid="MRK 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okwiiya kwa Mwana no Munu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mateu24.29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luka21.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24"/>Kono mu maywaa awo , en̄alelwa aba saibwe, eliywaa kame sa liilole, okweti kame sakwangwe okulita eliseli. <verse eid="MRK 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25"/>Etitungweti mbatikwi kuwilu, mi amaata naku wilu mba nyanganya. <verse eid="MRK 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26"/>Mi cwale kame samumone Omwana no munu yo keile mu makumbi ni maata no kuneneba ni kanya inene. <verse eid="MRK 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27"/>Cwale kame satume amangeloi aye, mu maneku anee no litunga okuunganya aanu anakete, okutangisa kumatatekelo no litunga okuta ku mamaneneno no liwilu.<verse eid="MRK 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Etuto no Sitondo no Mukuyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mateu24.32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luka21.29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28"/>Mukwiyete mu nguli no sitondo no mukuyu. Emitai yaso aba itangisa okotoba ni kushoshela amamuna mulimuke nji esilimwe kame sili beebi. <verse eid="MRK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29"/>Cwale naanyi ngeeso aba samumone eyambo eyo, sebeli itendahala mulimuke nji Omwana no munu sebeli oli beebi ni kwiiya. <verse eid="MRK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30"/>Niti luli kame ni myambela nji, olusika olu kalutamba kubwa einu eyi ekayasi tandahala kale. <verse eid="MRK 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31"/>Elitunga ni liwilu mba ibu kono amaywi ange katamba okubwa.<verse eid="MRK 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kakwisa Omunu Olimuka Eliywaa simba Enako</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Mateu24.36-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32"/>“Kono kakwisa omunu olimukile eliywaa simba enako eyo aba saiye simba Amangeloi naku wilu simba Omwana, konji Sitange yolimukile yomboci. <verse eid="MRK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33"/>Mutone, mutatelele mi mulapele, kakuli kamu limukile enako aba saitendahale. <verse eid="MRK 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34"/>Kame kukufekile kanyi omunu oli mu mwendo okusiya endoo yaye okuta ku ndina ni kusiya abika aye omunjili ni mujili kame abiwa omusebezi waye, mi ni woyo osikutatelela ba mweelo kame alaelelwa nji atatelele. <verse eid="MRK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35"/>Cwale mutatelele, kakuli kamu limukile enako eyo sakauke omunya ndoo, kana ni mangolwaa, simba bakaci no usiku, simba ba mikombwe aba saikuwe, nji enako no masiku. <verse eid="MRK 13:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36"/>Cwale nji kame saiye mu sipundumukela alese kumiwana musi langanine. <verse eid="MRK 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37"/>Mi esi ni myambela, kame ni sambela naanu onje mene nji mutatelele!”<verse eid="MRK 13:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14"/>
  <para style="s">Omulelo no Kwibaa Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mateu26.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1">Luka22.1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 2">2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Jowani11.45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1"/>Aba kunaku siyala amaywaa ayiili nji aingene mu mukiti no Paseka ni kulya kulin̄ende nambulwa omumena. Apulisita akulu na iyeti no mulawo ku mukunda sebeli saela omukwa no kulema Jesu nji amununge ni ku mwibaa. <verse eid="MRK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2"/>Sebeli amba nji, “Katufanene okumulema bano ba mukiti kakuli aanu mbatende emifili-fili ni kutufutukela.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu abana Waiwa Amaati ku Betaniya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mateu26.6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Jowani12.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3"/>Cwale Jesu yoli ku Beteniya mu ndoo ya Simoni osi mbingwa. Cwale Jesu yoikalile ku tafule, sebeli kwiiya omukati yoshimbile amaati no kunuka wino auliwa ba teko inene aisaniwa nadi. Sebeli ofukula ni kwitela amaati awo ku mutwi wa Jesu. <verse eid="MRK 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4"/>Kono aanu anjili ana kwikala omo ni Jesu sebeli atina nukwambisa mukati koo nji, “Iikene amaati aa aba asinyiwa ngeesi? <verse eid="MRK 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5"/>Kakuli kambe amaati aa naulisiwa amali no kubitelela emyanda yaatu ni kwaaba kwaanu no kusheba.” Mi sebeli atongoka onene kwa yonyene.<verse eid="MRK 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6"/>Kono cwale Jesu sebeli waambela nji, “Komumu siye yomboci, iikene mumushupela? Uyu mukati kame ana tende wino kwa mene. <verse eid="MRK 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7"/>Mba mwikala naanu no kusheba enako yonje, mi abo musingela bonje mba mwatusu. Kono kamutamba okwikalanga ni mene enako yonje. <verse eid="MRK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8"/>Uyu mukati natende eyi ana twese, na niwaa amaati no kunuka wino ba lutu lwange okululukisa mulibaka no kepelo yange. <verse eid="MRK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9"/>Mi niti luli kame nimyambela nji, konje oko sakaiyetiwe amaywi no kuwaba mu litunga lyonje, eyi ana tende uyu mukati mba yambiwa mukumu puluka.<verse eid="MRK 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Judasi abana Pumena Okubeteka Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mateu26.14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luka22.3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10"/>Cwale Judasi Isakalyota omunjili no aiyetwa aye no kukwana elikumi na yiili (12), sebeli ota kwa kulu no apulisita nji abeteke Jesu kwa onyene. <verse eid="MRK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11"/>Mi cwale abana kuyupa eyo sebeli awabelelwa onene ni kumusepisa okumuba amali. Cwale Judasi sebeli osaela omukwa no kubeteka Jesu.<verse eid="MRK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu abana Kulya Omulalelo no Paseka na Iyetwa Aye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mateu26.17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luka22.7-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">22.21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Jowani13.21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12"/>Cwale ba liywaa no matatekelo no mukiti no lin̄ende nambulwa omumena, abo abana kwibaa emikoko no kulya ba mukiti no paseka, cwale aiyetwa aye sebeli amwibanguta nji, “Kubine osinga nji tukaku lukisete nji ukalyeleko omulalelo no Paseka?”<verse eid="MRK 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli otuma aiyetwa aye ayiili ni kwaambela nji, “Mute mu tolopo, mi mba muwana omulume yo shimbile esindunga no meyi mi mumukon̄e, <verse eid="MRK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14"/>ku ndoo sakaingene, cwale mwambele omunya ndoo nji, “Omwiyeti naamba nji, kubine oli omusiyo wange oko sani lyele epaseka na iyetwa ange?’ <verse eid="MRK 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15"/>Cwale mba mimonisa omusiyo naku wilu omunene ona lukisiwa wino, omo mosa mukalukise einu yetu yonje.”<verse eid="MRK 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16"/>Cwale aiyetwa sebeli ata mu tolopo, mi sebeli awana einu yonje kanyi omo ana kwaambelela Jesu, mi sebeli alukisa eino kulya ba paseka.<verse eid="MRK 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17"/>Cwale aba kuna kutenda amangolwaa, Jesu sebeli oiya na iyetwa no kukwana elikumi na yiili (12). <verse eid="MRK 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18"/>Mi abaana lyaanga ba tafule, Jesu sebeli wamba nji, “Niti luli kame nimyambela nji, mumweya mukaci kenu mbani beteke mi kame nilya naye bamweya.”<verse eid="MRK 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19"/>Aiyetwa sebeli aena, ni kutateka oku mwibanguta omunjili ni munjili nji, “Kana meene?”<verse eid="MRK 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20"/>Jesu sebeli waatambula nji, “Mbatende mumweya kwanyi no kukwana likumi na yiili, mi kame lemine okubeeka elin̄ende lyaye mu siwana simweya ni mene. <verse eid="MRK 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21"/>Omwana no munu mbafu kanyi omoku n̄olelwe eyaye, kono oumayi ni wa woyo sobeteka Omwana no Munu! Ouwa kambe woyo mulume kasi kuleiwa.”<verse eid="MRK 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Omulalelo no Mbumu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mateu26.26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka22.14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Makolinte11.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22"/>Cwale alemine okulya ngeseo, Jesu sebeli oshimba esinkwa ni kulapela etapelo no oukutumela, ni kusipatola ni kuba aiyetwa aye, ni kwaambela nji, “Mushimbe, olu nilutu lwange.”<verse eid="MRK 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23"/>Kame Jesu sebeli oshimba ekomoki mi cwale abana mana oukutumela ni kwaaba mi sebeli anwa onje.<verse eid="MRK 14:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli waambela nji, “Ou ni unyinga wange no ulikani no ubya, ona itekelwe ano kupula. <verse eid="MRK 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25"/>Niti luli kame ni myambela nji, si tamba okunwa kame ku waine konji elyo liywaa aba sani kanwe kame eyi no ubya mu mubuso wa Nyambe.”<verse eid="MRK 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26"/>Cwale sebeli aimba olusimo ni kuta ku lilundu no itondo no Olibe.<verse eid="MRK 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Yoamba eyi no Kukana Kwa Pitolosi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mateu26.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka22.31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Jowani13.36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Moonje mba muni shotoka okuta oku no kuleba, kakuli kame kun̄olilwe nji, ‘Kame sani ibae omulisani mi emikoko yaye yonje mba ihasana.’ <verse eid="MRK 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28"/>Kono cwale munyima no kwinguka kwange, mbanimi ende ku lubala okuta ku Galileya”<verse eid="MRK 14:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29"/>Cwale Pitolosi sebeli wamba nji, “Simba nji onje mbaku siiyi oukutela, mene nyaa sitamba kuku siya.”<verse eid="MRK 14:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30"/>Mi Jesu sebeli wambela Pitolosi nji, “Niti luli kame nikwambela, balelo ouno usiku mbuni latula twaatu emikombwe ekayasilila kale twiili.”<verse eid="MRK 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31"/>Kono Pitolosi sebeli wamba okongota nji, “Simba okufa ni wene, sitamba kuku latula!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:31">Cwale na kwaye aiyetwa onje sebeli aamba yongeso.<verse eid="MRK 14:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Lapela mu Gasemani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mateu26.36-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luka22.39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32"/>Cwale sebeli ata ku sibaka siisaniwa Gesemani, mi Jesu sebeli wambela aiyetwa aye nji, “Kamwikale bano aba nisilapela.” <verse eid="MRK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli oshimba Pitolosi, Jakobo ni Jowani, sebeli otangisa oukushonda nuukukalelwa, <verse eid="MRK 14:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34"/>mi sebeli waambela nji, Omooyo yange kame wenine onene, okutwala balufu lwange, mwikale abano mi mutone.”<verse eid="MRK 14:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35"/>Mi sebeli waasiya okusheteta oku no kuleba mbicani, ni kukwela banji ni kulapela nji, nji kame kutwesahala eyi nako no mayando kambe ilese okwiiya kwa mene. <verse eid="MRK 14:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli olapela nji, “Abba,” Okutalusa nji, “Sitange! Einu yonje kame itwesahala kwa wene, otundise ekomoki eyi kwa mene, kulese kutendiwa esi singwa kwa mene, kono esi osinga wene.”<verse eid="MRK 14:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37"/>Cwale sebeli ouka kwa iyetwa aye ni kwawana alanganine, sebeli wambela Pitolosi nji, “Simoni, kame mulanganine? Kamutwese okutona simba ba hola imweya? <verse eid="MRK 14:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38"/>Komutone, mi mulapele nji mulese kwingena mu miliko kakuli Emebo kame isinga kono enyama kame ifokola.”<verse eid="MRK 14:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39"/>Cwale kame sebeli ouka oka lapela, okaamba amaywi akufekile. <verse eid="MRK 14:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40"/>Cwale sebeli ouka kame ni kwawana alanganine, kakuli amiyo oo neli ano kulema onene mi kasi kulimuka neyi noku mutambula.<verse eid="MRK 14:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41"/>Kame sebeli oiya akano waatu, ni kwaibanguta nji, “Musilanganine nuuku katulusa? Nakubu, enako yakeela kale. Omwana no Munu wabekiwa kale mu maoko no asikutenda ouyi. <verse eid="MRK 14:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42"/>Mwinguke, twendenyi, mwalikete, osikunibeteka sebeli oli beebi!”<verse eid="MRK 14:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu abana Nungiwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mateu26.47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka22.47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Jowani18.3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43"/>Cwale ababo Jesu yosamba, Judasi omunjili kwawo no kukwana elikumi na yiili sebeli okeela. Kame ana kwiya naanu no kupula ashimbile emikwale ni milamu, ana kutumiwa kwa kulu no apulisita, aiyeti no mulawo ni kwa kulu no aanu. <verse eid="MRK 14:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44"/>Cwale omubeteki sebeli oba aanu esisupo, no kwamba nji, “Woyo sani tubete yokame omulume musaela. Mumuleme ni kumushimba wino nji alese kushotoka.”<verse eid="MRK 14:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45"/>Mi cwale Judasi abana kukeela, sebeli osheteta kwa Jesu ababo ni kwamba nji, “Mwiyeti!” Niku mutubeta. <verse eid="MRK 14:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46"/>Cwale alume sebeli alema Jesu niku mununga. <verse eid="MRK 14:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47"/>Kono omunjili kwawo ana kwimananga ku manyonga sebeli oshomona omukwale waye ni kupatula omunjili omubika no mu Pulisita mukulu elitwi. <verse eid="MRK 14:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli waambela nji, “Kame muneeyi ni mikwale ni milamu muku nilema kanyi mbili mbuyi? <verse eid="MRK 14:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49"/>Etinako tonje nani kwikalanga nanyi okwiyeta mu ndoo ya Nyambe kono kamwa sikuninunga. Kono aman̄olo kame afanene okwiyatetetwa.”<verse eid="MRK 14:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50"/>Cwale aiyetwa aye sebeli ashotoka niku musiya.<verse eid="MRK 14:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51"/>Cwale kame kuna kwikalanga ondumbana onaku kon̄anga Jesu, yoku mangile feela olwambi ba lutu lwaye. Ni yonyene sebeli amushimba, <verse eid="MRK 14:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52"/>kono sebeli oshotoka yoli njeshe ni kusiya olwambi lwaye.<verse eid="MRK 14:52"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Twaliwa ku Kuta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Mateu26.57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54">Luka22.54</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:55">55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13">Jowani18.13</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:14">14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli otwaliwa ku ndoo no pulisita mukulu ni kwa pulisita ni kwakulu mane ni kwa iyeti no mulawo oko ana kuunganena. <verse eid="MRK 14:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54"/>Mi Pitolosi sebeli okon̄a Jesu munyima akatile mu lilapa no kuta no mupulisita mukulu, mi sebeli okaikala na tateleli yoyota omulilo. <verse eid="MRK 14:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55"/>Cwale apulisita akulu bamweya ni manduna no kuta no Majuda sebeli aibanguta Jesu nji awane omubonda owo sa twese okumwibaela, kono sebeli akwangwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56"/>Cwale aanu no kupula sebeli aamba eyi no mapwa nji amuwanenebo omubonda, kono oupaki woo neli wa mapwa.<verse eid="MRK 14:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57"/>Cwale anjili sebeli aimana niku munungelela oupaki no mapwa nji, <verse eid="MRK 14:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58"/>“Natu kumuyupa yo amba nji, ‘Kame nitwesa okushandaula endoo ya Nyambe eyi ina kuyakiwa kwaanu, mi munyima no maywaa aatu mbani twese okuyaka indina eyo kaitamba kuyakiwa kwaanu.’ ” <verse eid="MRK 14:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59"/>Kono simba abana kwamba ngeeso, oupaki woo kawasiku lumelelana. <verse eid="MRK 14:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60"/>Cwale omupulisita mukulu sebeli oimana ni kwibanguta Jesu nji, “Kakwisa eso otwesa okutambula eyo aamba aanu kwa wene?” <verse eid="MRK 14:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61"/>Kono Jesu sebeli wondoka feela, kasi kutambula esinjili. Mi kame apulisita akulu sebeli amwibanguta nji, “Yawene Kilesite omwana Nyambe ona fuyaulwa?”<verse eid="MRK 14:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli otambula nji, “ Yamene, mi mba mumono Omwana no munu yo ikalile ku lyoko no silyo no maata mi yo keile mu makumbi no liwilu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:62"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63"/>Cwale omupulisita no mukulu sebeli okaola eikumango yaye ni kwamba nji, “Iikene eyo tusisaelela oupaki kame! <verse eid="MRK 14:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64"/>Namuku yupele enyefulo yaye. Cwale anyi iikene munahana bo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:64">Mi cwale onje sebeli amwatula nji kame afanena okufa.<verse eid="MRK 14:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65"/>Cwale anjili sebeli atateka okumu sibwela amate, okumununga olwambi ba miyo, kumufula tin̄indi mame ni kumwambela nji onuhe kwaaci Kilesite anyine ona kufulu mane na tateleli nonyene sebeli amubakula etimaka.<verse eid="MRK 14:65"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pitolosi abana Latula Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Mateu26.69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luka22.56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Jowani18.15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66"/>Cwale Pitolosi yoli mu lilapa, omunjili no abika no mukatana no mupulisita mukulu sebeli oiya. <verse eid="MRK 14:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67"/>Mi abana kumona Pitolosi yoyota omulilo, sebeli omwaliketa ni kumwambela nji, “Ni wene kame ona kwikalanga ni Jesu no Nazaleta.”<verse eid="MRK 14:67"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68"/>Kono Pitolosi sebeli okana ni kwamba nji, “Silimukile mane ni kuyupisisa eyi wamba,” mi sebeli otunda okaimana ku mwelo [ababo omukombwe sebeli olila.]<verse eid="MRK 14:68"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69"/>Cwale omubika sebeli omumona mi sebeli wamba kame kwawo ana kwimananga naye nji, “Ni uyu omulume ni mumweya waawo ana kwikalanga ni Jesu.” <verse eid="MRK 14:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70"/>Kono kame Pitolosi sebeli okana,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:70">Mi munyima kame kwawo ana kwimananga sebeli aambela Pitolosi nji, “Niti luli ni wene, kame uli mumweya woo kakuli kame oli Omugalileya.” <verse eid="MRK 14:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71"/>Kono Pitolosi sebeli otateka okweeta ni kwamba nji, “Uyu mulume mwaamba, mene simuyii.”<verse eid="MRK 14:71"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72"/>Mi ababo omukombwe sebeli olila aka no wiili. Pitolosi sebeli opuluka eyo anaku mwambela Jesu nji, “Omukombwe owakasilila kale twiili mbunikana twaatu.” Mi sebeli waliketa banji ni kulila onene.<verse eid="MRK 14:72"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15"/>
  <para style="s">Jesu yoli Balubala lwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1">Mateu27.1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:2">2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luka23.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 8:28-38">Jowani8.28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1"/>Cwale amasikusiku, akulu no apulisita, na kulu na iyeti no mulawo na sikuta onje sebeli anahana emihupulo, mi sebeli anunga Jesu ni ku mu twala kwa Pilato. <verse eid="MRK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2"/>Cwale Pilato sebeli oibanguta Jesu nji, “Ninji yawene Ombumu no Majuda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:2">Jesu sebeli omutambula nji, “Kame wamba.”<verse eid="MRK 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3"/>Cwale akulu no apulisita kame ana ku mununga einu no kupula. <verse eid="MRK 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4"/>Mi Pilato sebeli oibanguta Jesu kame nji, “Ku kwite ekalabo no kutambula? Komone, kame akununga eyambo no kupula!”<verse eid="MRK 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5"/>Kono Jesu kasi ku tambula, cwale Pilato sebeli okomoka.<verse eid="MRK 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Atulelwa Olufu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mateu27.15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka23.13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39">Jowani18.39</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:16">19.16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6"/>Cwale ba nako no mukiti Pilato kame anakwa lukulwelanga omupantinti woyo ana kukumbelanga aanu nji alukululwe. <verse eid="MRK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7"/>Mi kwawo ana kunungiwa mu tolongo naku kwikala omulume no litina lya Balabasi ona ku lemiwa mu mubonda no kwibaa omunu ba mufilifili no kufutukela omubuso no naha. <verse eid="MRK 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8"/>Cwale aanu no kupula sebeli aiya niku tangisa okukumbela Pilato nji atendele kanyi omo ana kwatendelanga mu maywaa onje. <verse eid="MRK 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9"/>Cwale Pilato sebeli waaibanguta nji, “Kame mu singa nji ni milukulwele Ombumu no Majuda?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10"/>Pilato kame ana ku limbulula apulisita no akulu nji aba ana kumu litele Jesu, neli feela omuna. <verse eid="MRK 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11"/>Kono apulisita akulu sebeli asusuweza aanu nji akumbele Pilato okwa lukulwela Balabasi. <verse eid="MRK 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12"/>Mi Pilato kame sebeli waibanguta nji, “Cwale ngasibine sani tende, ni woyo mwamba nji ni Mbumu no Majuda?”<verse eid="MRK 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13"/>Cwale aanu sebeli akuweleza nji, “Angongotelwe!”<verse eid="MRK 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14"/>Cwale Pilato sebeli waaibanguta nji, “Siikene ana foso?” Kono sebeli akuweleza onene nji, “Angongotelwe!” <verse eid="MRK 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15"/>Cwale Pilato mu kusinga oku wabelisa aanu no kupula, sebeli waalukulwela Balabasi, Jesu sebeli oshapiwa, ni kumuba kwa onyene nji aka mungongotele.<verse eid="MRK 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Amasole abana Yandisa Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Mateu27.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2">Jowani19.2</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 19:3">3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16"/>Cwale amasole sebeli atwala Jesu mukaci no Kuta no mulenen̄i no mubusisi, mi sebeli oisana esitopa sonje no amasole. <verse eid="MRK 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli amufuka omukanjo no mucaa, ni ku mutingela en̄ata no myunguya ni kumufuka ku mutwi. <verse eid="MRK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18"/>Mi sebeli atangisa kumukeeta muku musheka aamba nji, “Yoosho Ombumu no Majuda!” <verse eid="MRK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli amufula olutaka ku mutwi ni ku musibwela amate ni kumu kubamena ni ku musheka. <verse eid="MRK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20"/>Mi cwale aba ana kumana oku mushubaula ngeeso, sebeli amufukula olwambi no mucaa ni ku mu fuka eikumango yaye, cwale sebeli amutwala oka mu ngongotela.<verse eid="MRK 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okutakisiwa kwa Jesu.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mateu27.32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka23.26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Jowani19.17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21"/>Cwale sebeli akandimeka omulume omunjili woyo ana kukubitelanga okutunda ku matema mi woyo neli Simoni Omusailini, sitoo Alekizanda ni Lufusi oku shimba esifapano sa Jesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22"/>Mi sebeli atwala Jesu ku sibaka sina kwisaniwa Gologota, okutalusa nji esibaka no Katendele. <verse eid="MRK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli amu litela ebeine ina kuwanekiwa ni Mila nji anwe, kono kasi kuinwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24"/>Mi sebeli amu ngongotela, nuuku tabela eikumango yaye muku shebuluka nji alimuke omunu ni munu eso sa shimbe. <verse eid="MRK 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25"/>Cwale neli ku ma 9 okuloko amasiku aba na kumu ngongotela. <verse eid="MRK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26"/>Mi omubonda ana kwatulelwa olufu kame una kun̄oliwa ba lin̄olo eli lili beulu lyamba nji, “Ombumu no Majuda.” <verse eid="MRK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli ongongotelwa ni ikebenga yiili, simweya ku silyo esinjli kweli no simoo. <verse eid="MRK 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28"/>Nakwiyatetetwe aman̄olo awo aamba nji, “Kame ana baliwa na sikucola omulawo”<verse eid="MRK 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29"/>Cwale aanu ana kubitanga mu ndila sebeli akuweleza niku musheka, aanyunga emitwi yoo ni kwamba nji, “Aha! Kayawene otwesa okusinya endoo ya Nyambe ni kwiyaka mu maywaa aatu! <verse eid="MRK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30"/>Okuyoyise mi otuluke ba sifapano! <verse eid="MRK 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31"/>Cwale akulu no apulisita sebeli amusheka ngeeso bamweya na iyeti no mulawo, aamba nji, “Kame anaku yoyisanga akwaye, kono yonyene katwese oukuyoyisa! <verse eid="MRK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32"/>Mu lesele uyu Kilesite Ombumu no Isilaele, atuluke ba sifapano cwale, nji tumone mi tu pumene mwa yonyene!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:32">Naawo ayiili ana ku ngongotelwa naye sebeli amwaangola.<verse eid="MRK 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Elufu lya Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mateu27.45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka23.44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Jowani19.28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33"/>Cwale omunji eliywaa aba lina kukela bakaci no mutwi kuma 12 okuloko, sebeli kwiiya ouwi ona kufuka enaha yonje oku twala aba lina kusiuluka ba nako no 15 okuluko. <verse eid="MRK 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34"/>Cwale ba nako no 15 okuluko Jesu sebeli okuwa ni liywi linene nji, “Eloi, eloi lemasabakatani? Okutalusa nji, “Nyambe wange, Nyambe wange, iikene aba oni leselela?”<verse eid="MRK 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35"/>Cwale awo ana kwimananga ba nyonga aba na kuyupa ngeseo sebeli amba nji, “Muyupe kame aisana Eliya!” <verse eid="MRK 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36"/>Mi omunjili sebeli oituka oka cupwa esiponji mu fenega ni ku litela Jesu nji anwe, ni kwamba nji, “Cwale musiyenyi tumone nji Eliya mba iiyi ku mu tulula ba sifapano!”<verse eid="MRK 15:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli okuwa ni liywi linene, mi sebeli obwelwa Emebo.<verse eid="MRK 15:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38"/>Cwale olwambi na mu Ndoo ya Nyambe sebeli lukauka bakaci oku tangisa ku wilu okutwala kunji. <verse eid="MRK 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39"/>Mi cwale omutateleli no musole ona kwimana ba nyonga ya Jesu aba na kumona omo ana fele, sebeli wamba nji, “Niti luli omulume uyu neli Mwana Nyambe!”<verse eid="MRK 15:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40"/>Akati ana kwimana oku no kuleba okumona, abo omunjili neli Maliya Magadalena, Maliya inawaye Jakobo omwanuke ni Jose okubeeka Salome. <verse eid="MRK 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41"/>Mu Galileya ana kwikalanga Jesu, akati kame ana kumu kon̄a ni kumu babalela. Nakati anjili ano kupula ana kumukon̄a oku tunda ku Jelusalema nonyene na kwikalako.<verse eid="MRK 15:41"/></para>
  <para style="s">Oku Pumbekiwa kwa Jesu.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mateu27.57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka23.50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Jowani19.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42"/>Cwale aba ina kukwana enako no mangolwaa neli eliywaa nou kutukiseta eliywaa no pumulo, <verse eid="MRK 15:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43"/>Josefa no Alimateya omunjili no Kuta no Majuda, woyo neli omunjili wawo ana kutatelelanga okwiiya no mubuso wa Nyambe, mu undume sebeli ota kwa Pilato okamu kumbela olutu lwa Jesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44"/>Pilato sebeli okomoka abana kuyupa nji Jesu wafa kale. Sebeli oisana omutateleli, ni ku mwibanguta nji Jesu wafa kale? <verse eid="MRK 15:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45"/>Cwale aba na kuyupa kwa mutateleli nji mo kwikalele, sebeli oba olutu ku mukulu no masole. <verse eid="MRK 15:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46"/>Cwale Josefa sebeli oula olwambi, niku pungelamo Jesu niku mubeeka mu libita no liwee no kuchakuliwa. Sebeli opindumunenabo eliwee ba mwelo no libita, <verse eid="MRK 15:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47"/>Maliya Magadalena ni Maliya inawaye Jose kame ana kumona omo ana kumu langeka Jesu.<verse eid="MRK 15:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16"/>
  <para style="s">Jesu abana Kwinguka Kwaafu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mateu28.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka24.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Jowani20.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1"/>Mi cwale elino pumulo aba lina kubwa, Maliya Magadalena ni Maliya inawaye Jacobo, ni Salome, sebeli a ula amaati no kunuka wino, nji akawae olutu lwa Jesu. <verse eid="MRK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2"/>Cwale amasiku luli ba liywa no weli mu sunda, sebeli ata ku libita abo eliywaa aba linakupa. <verse eid="MRK 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3"/>Mi sebeli akwambota mukaci koo nji, “Anyine osokatu tundiseta eliwee ba mwelo no libita?” <verse eid="MRK 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4"/>Kono aba ana kwaliketa, sebeli amona nji eliwee linene nali tundisiwabo ba libita. <verse eid="MRK 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5"/>Aba ana kwingena mu libita sebeli amona ondumbana yo kumangile olwambi no likena yoikalile ku silyo mi sebeli acila.<verse eid="MRK 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6"/>Mi sebeli waambela nji, “Mulese kucila, kame musaela Jesu no Nazaleta ona kungongotelwa. Na inguka! Kuno kasako. Mumone mu sibaka omo ana kumulangeka. <verse eid="MRK 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7"/>Kono mute, mukambele aiyetwa aye ni Pitolosi nji, ‘Kame akatile balubala lwenu okuta ku Galileya. Oko mbamu kamu mono kanyi omo ana ku myambelela.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8"/>Mi sebeli anjanjata ni ku komoko, cwale akati sebeli a tundako mukucila ku libita. Kasi kwamba esinjili kwaanu, kakuli kame ana kucila onene.<verse eid="MRK 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu abana Kumonahaza kwa Maliya Magadalena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9">Mateu28.9</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10">10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Jowani20.11-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9"/>Cwale Jesu aba ana kwinguka amasikusiku ba liywaa elino weli mu sunda, sebeli okumonahaza oweli kwa Maliya Magadalena, woyo ana kucita kwa yonyene Emebo no kwiiba mutanu ni twiili (7). <verse eid="MRK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10"/>Sebeli ota nukambela awo ana kwikalanga ni Jesu, kakuli kame ana kwikala mu maswabi ni ku lila. <verse eid="MRK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11"/>Kono abana kuyupa nji Jesu nainguka mi naamu mono, kasi kupumena.<verse eid="MRK 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yoku Monahaza kwa Iyetwa Aye Ayiili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mateu28.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka24.36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Jowani20.19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Tikezo1.6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12"/>Okutunda abo Jesu sebeli okumonahaza mumu monahalelo mundina kame kwa yiili. Eyi kame ina kutendahala aenda enda mu naha. <verse eid="MRK 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13"/>Awo ayiili aba ana kuuka sebeli ambela akoo, kono kaasi kwaa pumena.<verse eid="MRK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yoku Monahaza kwa Iyetwa aye no Kukwana Likumi ni Mumweya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14"/>Cwale okutunda abo Jesu sebeli okumonahaza kwa iyetwa likumi ni mumweya (11), aali ba tafule alemine okulya, sebeli waanyaza mu kuulwa okupumena koo, ni ku micima yoo no koongola, kakuli kasi kupumena kwaawo ana kumumona munyima no kwinguka kwaafu. <verse eid="MRK 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15"/>Cwale Jesu sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Mute mu litunga lyonje mwiyete eliywi no kuwaba ku munu yonje. <verse eid="MRK 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16"/>Omunu yonje woyo so pumena ni ku kolobeziwa mba yoyisiwa, kono omunu yonje woyo sokana okupumena mba biwi omubonda. <verse eid="MRK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17"/>Eyi eyisupo no timakazo eto sate nato awo apumena, kame sa cite amadimona mu litina lyange. Kame saambe mu tipuwo no ubya. <verse eid="MRK 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18"/>Kame saleme etinyoka ni maoko oo. Mi naba sanwe omulyashinji, kautamba okwalemeka. Kame sabeeke amaoko kwasi kutoma mi aanu awo mbabala.<verse eid="MRK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo Twaliwa ku Wilu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luka24.50-53</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Tikezo1.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19"/>Cwale Jesu aba na kumana okwamba noo, sebeli oshimbelwa ku wilu, ni ku kekala ku lyooko no silyo lya Nyambe. <verse eid="MRK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20"/>Cwale aiyetwa sebeli ata muku kutaza mu litunga lyonje, abo Mbumu yo sebeza noo mukoongoteteta elin̄usa mu libaka no timakazo ana kutendanga.<verse eid="MRK 16:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16"/>
</usx>
